<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">I Kwonik Yo</para>
  <para style="toc1">PREMYÈ KWONIK YO</para>
  <para style="toc2">I Kwonik Yo</para>
  <para style="toc3">I Kwo</para>
  <para style="mt1">I KWONIK YO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 1:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 4:24">Jen 4:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Adam, Seth, Énosch <verse eid="1CH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 1:2" />Kénan, Mahalaleel, Jéred, <verse eid="1CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 1:3" />Hénoc, Metuschélah, Lémec, <verse eid="1CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 1:4" />Noé, Sem, Cham avèk Japhet.<verse eid="1CH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 1:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 10:2-4">Jen 10:2-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis a Japhet yo: Gomer, Magog, Madaï, Javan, Tubal, Méschec avèk Tiras. <verse eid="1CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 1:6" />Fis a Gomer yo: Aschkenaz, Diphat, avèk Togarma. <verse eid="1CH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 1:7" />Fis a Javan yo: Élischa, Tarsisa, Kittim ak Rodanim.<verse eid="1CH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 1:8" />Fis a Cham yo: Cush, Mitsraïm, Puth avèk Canaan. <verse eid="1CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 1:9" />Fis a Cush yo: Saba, Havilla, Sabta, Raema avèk Sabteca. —Fis a Raema yo: Séba avèk Dedan. <verse eid="1CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 1:10" />Cush te fè Nimrod: se li menm ki te vin yon nonm pwisan sou latè a. <verse eid="1CH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 1:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:13-18">Jen 10:13-18</ref></char></note>Mitsarïm te fè moun a Ludim yo, Ananim yo, Lehabim yo, Naphtuhim yo, <verse eid="1CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 1:12" />Patrusim yo, Casluhim yo, sou sila Filisten yo te sòti avèk Kaftorimyen yo. <verse eid="1CH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 1:13" />Canaan te fè Sidon, premye ne li avèk Heth, <verse eid="1CH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 1:14" />avèk Jebizyen yo, Amoreyen yo ak Gigazyen yo, <verse eid="1CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 1:15" />Evyen yo, Akiyen yo, Siniyen yo, <verse eid="1CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 1:16" />Avadyen yo, Semariyen yo ak Amatyen yo.<verse eid="1CH 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 1:17" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 10:22-29">Jen 10:22-29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis a Sem yo: Élam, Assur, Arpacschad, Lud ak Aram; Uts, Hul, Guéter avèk Méschec. <verse eid="1CH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 1:18" />Arpacschad te fè Schélach; epi Schélach te fè Héber. <verse eid="1CH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 1:19" />De fis te fèt a Éber, non a youn se te Péleg; paske nan jou pa li yo, tè a te divize e non frè li a se te Joktan. <verse eid="1CH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 1:20" />Joktan te vin papa a Almodad, Schéleph, Hatsarmaveth, Jérach, <verse eid="1CH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 1:21" />Hadoram, Uzal, Dikla, <verse eid="1CH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 1:22" />Ébal, Abimaël, Séba, <verse eid="1CH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 1:23" />Ophir, Havila, avèk Jobab, tout sila te fis a Joktan. <verse eid="1CH 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 1:24" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:10-26">Jen 11:10-26</ref></char></note>Sem, Arpacschad, Schélach, <verse eid="1CH 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 1:25" />Héber, Péleg, Rehu, <verse eid="1CH 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 1:26" />Serug, Nachor, Térach, <verse eid="1CH 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 1:27" />Abram, ki se Abraham.<verse eid="1CH 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 1:28" />Fis a Abraham yo: Isaac avèk Ismaël. <verse eid="1CH 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 1:29" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:13-16">Jen 25:13-16</ref></char></note>desandan pa yo: Nebajoth, premye ne pou Ismaël, Kédar, Adbeel, Mibsam. <verse eid="1CH 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 1:30" />Mischma, Duma, Massa, Hadad, Téma, <verse eid="1CH 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 1:31" />Jethur, Naphisch ak Kedma: sila yo se te fis a Ismaël.<verse eid="1CH 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 1:32" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 25:1-4">Jen 25:1-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis a Ketura yo, ti mennaj a Abraham nan. Li te bay nesans a Zimran, Jokschan, Medan, Madain, Jischbak ak Schuach. —Fis a Jokschan yo: Séba avèk Dedan. <verse eid="1CH 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 1:33" />Fis a Madian yo: Épha, Épher, Hénoc, Abida avèk Eldaa—Tout sila yo se te fis a Ketura.<verse eid="1CH 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 1:34" />Abraham te fè Isaac. Fis a Isaac yo se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:25-26">Jen 25:25-26</ref></char></note>Ésaü avèk Israël. <verse eid="1CH 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 1:35" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 36:4-10">Jen 36:4-10</ref></char></note>Fis a Ésaü yo: Éliphaz, Reuel, Jeusch, Jaelam avèk Koré. <verse eid="1CH 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 1:36" />Fis a Éliphaz yo: Théman, Omar, Tsephi, Gaetham, Kenaz, Thimna avèk Amalek. <verse eid="1CH 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 1:37" />Fis a Reuel yo: Nahath, Zérach, Schamma avèk Mizza.<verse eid="1CH 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 1:38" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 36:4-10">Jen 36:4-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis a Séir yo: Lothan, Schobal, Tsibeon, Ana, Dischon, Etser avèk Dischan. <verse eid="1CH 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 1:39" />Fis a Lothan yo: Hori avèk Homam. Epi sè Lothan an te Thimna. <verse eid="1CH 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 1:40" />Fis a Schobal yo: Alijan, Manahath, Ébal, Schephi avèk Onam. Fis a Tsibeon yo: Ajja, avèk Ana. <verse eid="1CH 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 1:41" />Fis a Ana a: Dischon. Fis a Dischon yo: Hamran, Eschban, Jitran avèk Keran. <verse eid="1CH 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 1:42" />Fis a Etser yo: Bilhan, Zaavan avèk Jaakan. Fis a Dischan yo: Uts avèk Aran.<verse eid="1CH 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 1:43" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:43 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 36:31-43">Jen 36:31-43</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, sila yo se wa ki te renye nan peyi Édom an avan te gen wa an Israël. Béla, fis a Beor la; epi non a vil pa li a se te Dinhaba. <verse eid="1CH 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 1:44" />Béla te mouri; epi Jobab, fis a Zérach ki sòti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:6">És 34:6</ref></char></note>Botsra a, te renye nan plas li. <verse eid="1CH 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 1:45" />Jobab te mouri e Huscham a peyi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 2:11">Job 2:11</ref></char></note>Temanit yo te renye nan plas li. <verse eid="1CH 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 1:46" />Huscham te mouri; epi Hadad, fis a Bedad la, te renye nan plas li. Se te li menm ki te frape Madian nan chan Moab la. Non a vil sa a se te Avith. <verse eid="1CH 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 1:47" />Hadad te mouri; epi Samia a Maskéka te renye nan plas li. <verse eid="1CH 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 1:48" />Samia te mouri; epi Saül a Rehoboth kote flèv la te renye nan plas li. <verse eid="1CH 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 1:49" />Saül te mouri; epi Baal-Hanan, fis a Acbor a te renye nan plas li. <verse eid="1CH 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 1:50" />Baal-Hanan te mouri; epi Hadad te renye nan plas li. Non a vil sa a se te Pahi; epi non a madanm li se te Mehéthabeel, fi a Mathred la, fi a Mézahab la. <verse eid="1CH 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 1:51" />Hadad te mouri. Chèf a Édom yo te chèf Thimna, chèf Alia, chèf Jetheth, <verse eid="1CH 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 1:52" />chèf Oholibama, chèf Éla ak chèf Pinon, <verse eid="1CH 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 1:53" />chèf Kenaz, chèf Théman, chèf Mibtsar, <verse eid="1CH 1:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 1:54" />chèf Magdiel, chèf Iram. Sila yo se te chèf Édom yo.<verse eid="1CH 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CH 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 2:1" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:22-26">Jen 35:22-26</ref></char></note>fis Israël yo: Ruben, Siméon, Lévi, Juda, Issacar, Zabulon, <verse eid="1CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 2:2" />Dan, Joseph, Benjamin, Nephthali, Gad ak Aser.<verse eid="1CH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 2:3" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 38:2-10">Jen 38:2-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis a Juda yo: Er, Onan, Schéla; twa fèt a li menm pa Bath-Schua, Kananeyen nan. Er, premye ne a Juda a, se te mechan nan zye SENYÈ a, ki te mete li a lanmò. <verse eid="1CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 2:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 38:13-30">Jen 38:13-30</ref></char></note>Tamar, bèlfi a Juda a, te bay nesans a Pérets avèk Zérach. Kantite antou a fis Juda yo, senk.<verse eid="1CH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 2:5" />Fis a Pérets yo: Hetsron avèk Hamul. <verse eid="1CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 2:6" />Fis a Zérach yo: Zimri, Éthan, Héman, Calcol avèk Dara. An total: senk. <verse eid="1CH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 2:7" />Fis a Carmi yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:1">Jos 7:1</ref></char></note>Acar, ki te twouble Israël lè l te vyole bagay anba ve yo. <verse eid="1CH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 2:8" />Fis a Éthan an: Azaria.<verse eid="1CH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 2:9" />Fis ki ne a Hetsron yo: Jerachmeel, Ram, avèk Kelubaï. <verse eid="1CH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 2:10" />Ram te fè Amminadab. Amminadab te fè Nachschon, chèf a fis a Juda yo. <verse eid="1CH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 2:11" />Nachschon te fè Salma. Salma te fè Boaz. <verse eid="1CH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 2:12" />Boaz te fè Obed. Obed te fè Jesse, <verse eid="1CH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 2:13" />Jesse te fè Éliab, fis premye ne a, Abinadab, dezyèm nan, Schimea, twazyèm nan, <verse eid="1CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 2:14" />Nethaneel, katriyèm nan, Raddaï, senkyèm nan, <verse eid="1CH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 2:15" />Otsem, sizyèm nan, David, setyèm nan. <verse eid="1CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 2:16" />Sè pa yo se te: Tseruja avèk Abigaïl. Epi twa fis a Tserula yo: Abischaï, Joab avèk Asaël, twa. <verse eid="1CH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 2:17" />Abigaïl te fè Amasa: papa Amasa se te Jéther, avèk Izmayelit la.<verse eid="1CH 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 2:18" />Caleb, fis a Hetsron an te fè de fis avèk Azuba, madanm li e de pa Jerioth; alò, sa yo se te fis li yo: Jéscher, Schobab avèk Ardon. <verse eid="1CH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 2:19" />Azuba te mouri; epi Caleb te pran Éphrath ki te fè Hur pou li. <verse eid="1CH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 2:20" />Hur te fè Uri e Uri te fè Betsaleel.<verse eid="1CH 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 2:21" />Apre, Hetsron te ale kote fi a Makir a, papa a Galaad e li te gen swasant ane depi li te marye avè l; epi li te fè pou li Segub. <verse eid="1CH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 2:22" />Segub te fè Jaïr, ki te gen venn-twa vil nan peyi Galaad. <verse eid="1CH 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 2:23" />Men Gechouryen yo avèk Siryen yo te rache vil Jaïr yo nan men yo avèk Kenath ak vil pa li yo, menm swasant vil. Tout sila yo se te fis a Makir yo, papa a Galaad. <verse eid="1CH 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 2:24" />Lè Hetsron te fin mouri nan Caleb-Éphrata, Abija, fanm Hetsron an, te fè pou li, Aschchur, papa a Tekoa.<verse eid="1CH 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 2:25" />Fis a Jerachmeel yo, premye ne a Hetsron an: Ram, premye ne, Buna, Oren avèk Otsem, ne a Achija. <verse eid="1CH 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 2:26" />Jerachmeel te gen yon lòt fanm ki te rele Athara e ki te manman a Onam. <verse eid="1CH 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 2:27" />Fis a Ram yo, premye ne a Jerachmeel, te Maatys, Jamin, avèk Éker. <verse eid="1CH 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 2:28" />Fis a Onam yo te Schammaï avèk Jada. Fis a Schammaï yo: Nadab avèk Abischur. <verse eid="1CH 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 2:29" />Non a fanm Abischur a te Abichail e li te fè pou li Achban avèk Molid. <verse eid="1CH 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 2:30" />Fis a Nadab yo: Séled avèk Appaïm. Séled te mouri san fis. <verse eid="1CH 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 2:31" />Fis a Appaïm nan: Jischeï. Fis a Jischeï a: Schéschan. Fis a Schéschan nan: Achlaï. <verse eid="1CH 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 2:32" />Fis a Jada yo, frè a Schammaï: Jéther avèk Jonathan. Jéther te mouri san fis. <verse eid="1CH 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 2:33" />Fis a Jonathan yo: Péleth avèk Zaza. Sila yo se te fis a Jerachmeel. <verse eid="1CH 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 2:34" />Schéschan pa t gen fis, men sèlman fi. Schéschan te gen yon esklav Ejipsyen ki te rele Jarcha. <verse eid="1CH 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 2:35" />Epi Schéschan te bay fi li kon madanm a Jarcha, esklav li a e li te fè pou li, Attaï. <verse eid="1CH 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 2:36" />Attaï te fè Nathan; Nathan te fè Zabad; <verse eid="1CH 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 2:37" />Zabad te fè Ephlal; Ephlal te fè Obed; <verse eid="1CH 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 2:38" />Obed te fè Jéhu; Jéhu te fè Azaria; <verse eid="1CH 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 2:39" />Azaria te fè Halets; Halets te fè Élasa; <verse eid="1CH 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 2:40" />Élasa te fè Sismaï; Sismaï te fè Schallum; <verse eid="1CH 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 2:41" />Schallum te fè Jekamja; Jekamaja te fè Élischama.<verse eid="1CH 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 2:42" />Alò, fis a Caleb yo, frè a Jerachmeel la: Méscha, fis premye ne a, ki te vin papa a Ziph e fis pa li a se te Maréscha, papa a Hébron. <verse eid="1CH 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 2:43" />Fis a Hébron yo: Koré, Thappuach, Rékem avèk Schéma. <verse eid="1CH 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 2:44" />Schéma te fè Racham, papa a Jorkeam. Rékem te fè Schammaï. <verse eid="1CH 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 2:45" />Fis a Schammaï a: Maon; epi Maon te papa a Beth-Tsur. <verse eid="1CH 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 2:46" />Épha, ti mennaj a Caleb la, te fè Haran, Motsa avèk Gazez. <verse eid="1CH 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 2:47" />Fis a Jahdaï a: Réguem, Jotham, Guéschan, Péleth, Épha avèk Schaaph. <verse eid="1CH 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 2:48" />Maaca, ti mennaj a Caleb la te fè Schéber avèk Tirchana. <verse eid="1CH 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 2:49" />Li te fè ankò Schaaph, papa a Madmanna, avèk Scheva, papa a Macbéna, papa a Guibea. Fi a Caleb la te Acsa.<verse eid="1CH 2:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 2:50" />Men fis a Caleb yo: Fis a Hur yo, premye ne a Éphrata a e papa a Kirjath-Jearim; <verse eid="1CH 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 2:51" />Salma, papa a Bethléem; Hareph, papa a Beth-Gader. <verse eid="1CH 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 2:52" />Fis a Shobal yo, papa a Kirjath-Jearim te Haroé, Hatsi-Hammenuhoth. <verse eid="1CH 2:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 2:53" />Fanmi a Kirjath-Jerim yo se te: Jetriyen yo, Pityen yo, Choumatyen yo ak Mischrayen yo; depi nan fanmi sila yo, te sòti Soreatyen yo avèk Eschtaolyen yo. <verse eid="1CH 2:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 2:54" />Fis a Salma yo: Bethléem avèk Netofatyen yo, Athroth-Beth-Joab, Hatsi-Hammanachthi, Soreyen yo; <verse eid="1CH 2:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 2:55" />epi fanmi a skrib ki te rete Jaebets yo: Tireatyen yo, Schimeatyen yo ak Sikatyen yo. Sila yo se Kenyen ki te soti nan Hamath yo, papa lakay Récab.<verse eid="1CH 2:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 3:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 3:2-5">II Sam 3:2-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, sila yo se te fis a David ke li te fè Hébron yo. Premye ne a, Amnon, pa Achinoam ak Jizreel; dezyèm nan, Daniel ak Abigaïl, moun Carmel la; <verse eid="1CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 3:2" />Twazyèm nan, Absalom, fis a Maaca a, fi a Talmaï a, wa Gueschur a; katriyèm nan, Adonija, fis a Haggith la; <verse eid="1CH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 3:3" />senkyèm nan, Schephatia, pa Abithai; sizyèm nan, Jithream pa Élga, madanm li. <verse eid="1CH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 3:4" />Se sis ki te fèt a li Hébron. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:4-5">II Sam 5:4-5</ref></char></note>La, li te renye pandan setan si mwa e li te renye pandan trann-twazan Jérusalem. <verse eid="1CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 3:5" />Men sila ki te fèt a li Jérusalem yo: Schimea, Schobab, Nathan avèk Salomon, kat pa Bath-Schua, fi a Ammiel la; <verse eid="1CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 3:6" />avèk Jibhar, Élischama, Éliphéleth, <verse eid="1CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 3:7" />Noga, Népheg, Japhia, Élischama, <verse eid="1CH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 3:8" />Éliada avèk Éliphéleth, nèf. <verse eid="1CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 3:9" />Tout sila yo se fis a David, anplis, fis a ti mennaj li yo; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 13:1">II Sam 13:1</ref></char></note>Tamar te sè li.<verse eid="1CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 3:10" />Fis a Salomon an: Roboam. Abijah, fis pa li a; Asa, fis pa li a; Josaphat, fis pa li a; <verse eid="1CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 3:11" />Joram, fis pa li a; Achazia, fis pa li a; Joas, fis pa li a; <verse eid="1CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 3:12" />Amatsia, fis pa li a: Azaria, fis pa li a; Jotham, fis pa li a; <verse eid="1CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 3:13" />Achaz, fis pa li a; Ézéchias, fis pa li a; Manassé, fis pa li a; <verse eid="1CH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 3:14" />Amon, fis pa li a; Josias, fis pa li a. <verse eid="1CH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 3:15" />Fis a Josias yo: Jochanan, premye ne a; dezyèm nan, Jojakim; twazyèm nan, Sédécias; katriyèm nan, Schallum. <verse eid="1CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 3:16" />Fis a Jojakim yo: Jéconias, fis li a, avèk Zedekiah, fis li a. <verse eid="1CH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 3:17" />Fis a Jéconias yo, prizonye a: Schealthiel, fis li a, <verse eid="1CH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 3:18" />epi Malkiram, Pedaja, Schénatsar, Jekamia, Hoschama ak Nedabia. <verse eid="1CH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 3:19" />Fis a Pedaja yo: Zorobabel avèk Schimeï. Fis a Zorobabel yo: Meschullam avèk Hanania; epi Schelomith, sè pa yo; <verse eid="1CH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 3:20" />avèk Haschuba, Ohel, Bérékia, Hasadia, Juschab-Hésed, senk. <verse eid="1CH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 3:21" />Fis a Hanaja yo: Pelathia avèk Ésaïe; fis a Rephaja yo, fis a Arnan yo, fis a Abdias yo, fis a Schecania yo. <verse eid="1CH 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 3:22" />Desandan a Schecania yo se te Schemaeja ak fis a Schemaeja yo, Hattusch, Jigueal, Bariach, Nearia ak Schaphath, sis. <verse eid="1CH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 3:23" />Fis a Nearia yo: Eljoénaï, Ézéchias ak Azrikam, twa. <verse eid="1CH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 3:24" />Fis a Eljoénaï yo: Hodavia, Éliaschib, Pelaja, Akkub, Jochanan, Delaja ak Anani, sèt.<verse eid="1CH 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CH 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 4:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 2:3">I Kwo 2:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis a Juda yo: Pérets, Hetsron, Carmi, Hur ak Shobal. <verse eid="1CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 4:2" />Reaja, fis a Shobal la, te vin papa a Jachath; Jachath te fè Achumaï avèk Lahad. Sila yo se te fanmi a Soreatyen yo. <verse eid="1CH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 4:3" />Men desandan a Étham yo: Jizreel, Jischma ak Jidbach; sè yo te rele Hatselelponi. <verse eid="1CH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 4:4" />Penuel se te papa a Guedor e Ézer papa a Huscha. Men fis a Hur yo; premye ne a, Éphrata, papa a Bethléem. <verse eid="1CH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 4:5" />Aschchur, papa a Tekoa, te gen de madanm: Hélea avèk Naara. <verse eid="1CH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 4:6" />Naara te fè pou li Achuzzam, Hépher, Thémeni ak Ashaschthari: men fis a Naara yo. <verse eid="1CH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 4:7" />Fis a Hélea yo: Tséreth, Tsochar ak Ethnan. <verse eid="1CH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 4:8" />Kots te fè Anub avèk Hatsobéba ak fanmi a Acharchel yo, fis a Harum yo.<verse eid="1CH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 4:9" />Jaebets te gen plis onè pase frè li yo e manman li te rele li Jaebets epi te di: “akoz mwen te fè l avèk gwo doulè”.<verse eid="1CH 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 4:10" />Jaebets te rele Bondye Israël la epi te di: “O ke Ou beni mwen, anverite e agrandi lizyè mwen e ke men Ou avè m, ke Ou pwoteje m de mal pou m pa ta twouble akoz li.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 4:10">Epi Bondye te bay li sa li te mande a.<verse eid="1CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 4:11" />Kelub, frè a Schucha a, te fè Mechir ki te papa a Eschthon. <verse eid="1CH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 4:12" />Eschthon te soti lakay Rapha, Paséach ak Thechinna, papa a Nachasch. Sila yo se te moun a Réca yo. <verse eid="1CH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 4:13" />Alò, fis a Kenaz yo: Othniel avèk Seraja. Fis a Othniel la: Hathath. <verse eid="1CH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 4:14" />Meonothaï te fè Ophra. Seraja te fè Joab, papa a atizan yo; paske li menm te yon atizan. <verse eid="1CH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 4:15" />Fis a Caleb yo, ki te fis a Jephunné a: Iru, Éla avèk Naam e fi yo, Éla avèk Kenaz. <verse eid="1CH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 4:16" />Fis a Jehalléleel yo: Ziph, Zipha, Thirja ak Asareel. <verse eid="1CH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 4:17" />Fis a Esdras yo: Jéther, Méred, Épher ak Jalon. Madanm a Méred la te fè Miriam, Schammaï ak Jischbach, papa Eschthemoa. <verse eid="1CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 4:18" />Madanm li, Juif te fè Jéred, papa a Guedor, Héber, papa a Soco, avèk Jekuthiel, papa a Zanoach. <verse eid="1CH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 4:19" />Fis a madanm a Hodija yo, sè a Nacham nan, se te zansèt a Kehila yo, Gamyen yo, ak Eschthemoa, Maakatyen yo. <verse eid="1CH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 4:20" />Fis a Simon yo: Amnon, Rinna, Ben-Hanan ak Thilon. Epi fis a Jischeï yo: Zocheth ak Ben-Zocheth. <verse eid="1CH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 4:21" />Fis a Schéla yo, ki te fis a Juda a: Er, papa a Léca, Laeda, papa a Maréscha, avèk fanmi lakay travayè twal nan Béth-Aschbéa yo, <verse eid="1CH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 4:22" />avèk Jokim, mesye a Cozéba yo, Joas ak Saraph, ki te renye Moab avèk Jaschubi-Léchem. Achiv sila yo tèlman ansyen. <verse eid="1CH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 4:23" />Sila yo se te moun ki te fè veso ajil ki te abite Netayaim avèk Gedera; yo te rete la avèk wa a pou fè travay li. <verse eid="1CH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 4:24" />Fis a Siméon yo: Nemuel, Jamin, Jarib, Zérach, Saül. <verse eid="1CH 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 4:25" />Schallum, fis li a. Mibsam, fis li a. <verse eid="1CH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 4:26" />Fis a Mischma yo: Hammuel, fis li a, Zaccur, fis li a ak Schimeï, fis li a. <verse eid="1CH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 4:27" />Schimeï te gen sèz fis avèk sis fi. Frè li yo pa t fè anpil fis, ni fanmi pa yo pa t miltipliye kon fis a Juda yo. <verse eid="1CH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 4:28" />Yo te rete Beer-Schéba, nan Molada ak nan Hatsar-Schual, <verse eid="1CH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 4:29" />nan Bilha, nan Etsem, nan Tholad, <verse eid="1CH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 4:30" />nan Bethuel, nan Horma, nan Tsiklag, <verse eid="1CH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 4:31" />nan Beth-Marcaboth, nan Hatsar-Susim, nan Beth-Bireï ak nan Schaaraïm. Sila yo se te vil pa yo jiska règn a wa David la. <verse eid="1CH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 4:32" />Vilaj pa yo te Etham, Ain, Rimmon, Thoken ak Aschan, senk vil yo; <verse eid="1CH 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 4:33" />epi tout vil pa yo ki te antoure menm vil sila yo jis rive Baal. Se te anplasman pa yo e yo genyen istwa zansèt pa yo. <verse eid="1CH 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 4:34" />Meschobab, Jamlec, Joscha, fis a Amatsia a; <verse eid="1CH 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 4:35" />epi Joël avèk Jéhu, fis a Joschibia a, fis a Seraia a, fis a Asiel la; <verse eid="1CH 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 4:36" />Eljoénaï, Jaakoba, Jeschochaja, Asaja, Adiel, Jesimiel, Benaja, <verse eid="1CH 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 4:37" />Ziza, fis a Allon an, fis a Jedaja a, fis a Schimri a, fis a Schemaeja a. <verse eid="1CH 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 4:38" />Sila ki mansyone pa non yo se te chèf lakay fanmi pa yo; epi lakay zansèt pa yo te chèf nan fanmi pa yo e lakay fanmi pa yo te grandi anpil. <verse eid="1CH 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 4:39" />Yo te rive jis nan antre Guedor, jis nan kote lès a vale a pou chache patiraj pou twoupo pa yo. <verse eid="1CH 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 4:40" />Yo te jwenn pa yo ki te trè rich e trè bon, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 18:7-10">Jij 18:7-10</ref></char></note>peyi a te vas e kalm, epi te gen lapè; paske sila ki te rete la oparavan yo te desandan de Cham. <verse eid="1CH 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 4:41" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 4:33-38">I Kwo 4:33-38</ref></char></note>Sila yo, dechifre pa non te vini nan jou a Ézéchias yo, wa Juda a e te atake tant pa yo e avèk Mawonit ki te rete la yo, te detwi yo nèt jis rive jou sa a pou te rete nan plas pa yo, akoz te gen patiraj pou twoupo pa yo. <verse eid="1CH 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 4:42" />Sòti nan yo, depi nan fis Siméon, senk-san mesye te monte nan Mòn Séir avèk Pelathia, Nearia, Rephaja e Uziel, fis a Jischeï a. <verse eid="1CH 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 4:43" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:7-8">I Sam 15:7-8</ref></char></note>Yo te detwi retay Amalekit ki te chape yo e te rete la jis rive jodi a.<verse eid="1CH 4:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 5:1" />Alò, fis a Ruben yo, premye ne an Israël la (paske se te premye ne li te ye, men akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:22">Jen 35:22</ref></char></note>li te konwonpi kabann papa li, dwa nesans li te bay a fis a Joseph yo, fis Israël la; epi pou sa, li pa anwole nan istwa desandan yo selon dwa nesans lan. <verse eid="1CH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 5:2" />Sepandan Juda te reyisi depase frè li yo e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mi 5:2</ref></char></note>soti nan li, chèf la te parèt, malgre dwa nesans lan te pou Joseph), <verse eid="1CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 5:3" />fis a Ruben yo, premye ne an Israël la: Hénoc, Pallu, Hetsron ak Carmi. <verse eid="1CH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 5:4" />Fis a Joël yo: Schemaeja, fis pa li a, Gog, fis pa li a; Schimeï, fis pa li a; <verse eid="1CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 5:5" />Michée, fis pa li a; Reaja, fis pa li a; Baal, fis pa li a. <verse eid="1CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 5:6" />Beéra, fis pa li a ke Tilgath-Pilnéser, wa Assyrie a te mennen an kaptivite: li te chèf a Ribenit yo. <verse eid="1CH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 5:7" />Fanmi a Beéra yo, selon fanmi pa yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 5:17">I Kwo 5:17</ref></char></note>nan istwa zansèt yo te Jeiel, chèf la ak Zechariah. <verse eid="1CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 5:8" />Epi Béla, fis a Azaz la, fis a Schéma a, fis a Joël la. Béla te rete Aroër e teritwa yo te jiska Neb ak Baal-Meon; <verse eid="1CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 5:9" />nan lès, li te rete jis rive nan antre dezè a soti nan rivyè Euphrate la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 22:8-9">Jos 22:8-9</ref></char></note>akoz bèt pa yo te tèlman ogmante nan peyi Galaad la.<verse eid="1CH 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 5:10" />Nan jou a Saül yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 5:18-21">I Kwo 5:18-21</ref></char></note>yo te fè lagè avèk Agarenyen ki te tonbe pa men yo, jiskaske yo te vin rete nan tant pa yo toupatou nan tout teritwa lès a Galaad la.<verse eid="1CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 5:11" />Alò, fis a Gad yo te rete anfas yo nan peyi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:11">Jos 13:11</ref></char></note>Basan an jis rive Salca. <verse eid="1CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 5:12" />Joël te chèf e Schapham te dezyèm nan ak Jaenaï avèk Schaphath nan Basan. <verse eid="1CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 5:13" />Fanmi pa yo selon lakay papa yo: Micaël, Meschullam, Schéba, Joraï, Zia ak Éber, sèt antou. <verse eid="1CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 5:14" />Sila yo se te fis a Abichaïl yo, fis a Huri a, fis a Jaroach la, fis a Galaad la, fis a Micaël la, fis a Jeschischaï a, fis a Jachdo a, fis a Buz la; <verse eid="1CH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 5:15" />Achi, fis a Abdiel la, fis a Guni a, tèt lakay papa yo. <verse eid="1CH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 5:16" />Yo te rete Galaad nan Basan, nan vil pa li yo ak nan tout teren patiraj yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:2">És 35:2</ref></char></note>Saron jis rive nan limit lizyè pa yo. <verse eid="1CH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 5:17" />Tout sila yo te anwole nan chif zansèt yo nan jou a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:5-32">II Wa 15:5-32</ref></char></note>Jotham yo, wa Juda a ak nan jou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:16-28">II Wa 14:16-28</ref></char></note>Jéroboam yo, wa Israël.<verse eid="1CH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 5:18" />Fis a Ruben yo ak Gadit yo avèk mwatye Manassé yo, mesye a gwo kouraj yo, mesye ki te pote boukliye avèk nepe yo, te tire avèk banza e yo te fò nan batay, karant-kat-mil-sèt-san-swasant moun ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:3">Nonb 1:3</ref></char></note>ale nan gè a. <verse eid="1CH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 5:19" />Yo te fè lagè kont Agarenyen yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:15">Jen 25:15</ref></char></note>Jethur, Naphisch ak Nodab. <verse eid="1CH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 5:20" />Yo te twouve soutyen kont yo e Agarenyen yo avèk tout sila ki te avèk yo te livre nan men yo; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:11-13">II Kwo 14:11-13</ref></char></note>yo te kriye fò a Bondye nan batay la e Li te reponn lapriyè yo, akoz yo te mete konfyans yo nan Li. <verse eid="1CH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 5:21" />Yo te pran tout twoupo bèt yo: senkant-mil chamo, de-san-senkant-mil mouton, de-mil bourik; epi san-mil òm. <verse eid="1CH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 5:22" />Paske anpil moun te mouri, akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 23:10">Jos 23:10</ref></char></note>lagè a te sòti nan Bondye. Epi yo te vin rete nan plas pa yo jis rive nan lè egzil la.<verse eid="1CH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 5:23" />Alò, fis a mwatye tribi Manassé yo te rete nan peyi a; soti nan Bashan jis rive nan Baal-Hermon avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:9">Det 3:9</ref></char></note>Senir e Mòn Hermon yo te anpil. <verse eid="1CH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 5:24" />Sila yo se te tèt lakay zansèt yo, menm Épher, Jischeï, Éliel, Azriel, Jérémie Hodavia ak Jachrenom; mesye gwo kouraj yo, chèf lakay zansèt pa yo. <verse eid="1CH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 5:25" />Men yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:15-18">Det 32:15-18</ref></char></note>aji avèk trayizon kont Bondye a papa yo a e te jwe pwostitiye a nan kouri dèyè dye a pèp peyi ke Bondye te detwi devan yo a. <verse eid="1CH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 5:26" />Pou sa, Bondye Israël la te chofe lespri a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:19-20">II Wa 15:19-20</ref></char></note>Pul, wa Assyrie a, menm lespri a Tilgath-Pilnéser, wa Assyrie a e li te pote yo ale an egzil, menm Ribenit yo, Gadit yo ak mwatye tribi Manassé yo e te fè yo rive nan Chalach, nan Chabor, nan Hara ak nan flèv Gozan nan, kote yo rete menm jis rive jodi a.<verse eid="1CH 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CH 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 6:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 46:11">Jen 46:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis a Lévi yo: Guerschom, Kehath ak Merari. <verse eid="1CH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 6:2" />Fis a Kehath yo: Amram, Jitsehar, Hébron ak Uziel. <verse eid="1CH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 6:3" />Pitit a Amram yo: Aaron avèk Moïse ak Marie. Fis a Aaron yo: Nadab, Abihu, Éléazar ak Ithamar. <verse eid="1CH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 6:4" />Éléazar te vin papa a Phinées; Phinées te vin papa a Abischua; <verse eid="1CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 6:5" />Abischua te vin papa a Bukki e Bukki te vin papa a Uzzi, <verse eid="1CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 6:6" />epi Uzzi te vin papa a Zerachja; Zerachja te vin papa a Merajoth; <verse eid="1CH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 6:7" />Merajoth te vin papa a Amaria; Amaria te vin papa a Achithub; <verse eid="1CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 6:8" />epi Achithub te vin papa a Tsadok e Tsadok <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:27">II Sam 15:27</ref></char></note>te vin papa a Achimaats; <verse eid="1CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 6:9" />epi Achimaats te vin papa a Azaria; Azaria te vin papa a Jochanan; <verse eid="1CH 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 6:10" />Jochanan te vin papa a Azaria, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 26:17">II Kwo 26:17</ref></char></note>ki te fè sèvis kon prèt nan kay ke Salomon te bati Jérusalem nan; <verse eid="1CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 6:11" />epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:3">Esd 7:3</ref></char></note>Azaria te vin papa a Amaria; Amaria te vin papa a Achithub; <verse eid="1CH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 6:12" />Achithub te vin papa a Tsadok; Tsadok te vin papa a Schallum; <verse eid="1CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 6:13" />Schallum te vin papa a Hilkija, Hilkija te vin papa Azaria; <verse eid="1CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 6:14" />Azaria te vin papa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 11:11">Né 11:11</ref></char></note>Seraja; Seraja te vin papa a Jehotsadak. <verse eid="1CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 6:15" />Jehotsadak te ale lè SENYÈ a te pote Juda avèk Jérusalem ale an egzil pa Nebucadnetsar.<verse eid="1CH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 6:16" />Fis a Lévi yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:11">Jen 46:11</ref></char></note>Guerschom, Kehath ak Merari. <verse eid="1CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 6:17" />Sila yo se non a fis a Guerschom yo: Libni avèk Schimeï. <verse eid="1CH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 6:18" />Fis a Kehath yo: Amram, Jitsehar, Hébron ak Uziel. <verse eid="1CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 6:19" />Fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:33">Nonb 3:33</ref></char></note>Merari yo: Machli ak Muschi. Epi sila yo se fanmi a Levit yo selon zansèt pa yo. <verse eid="1CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 6:20" />Selon Guerschom: Libni, fis li a, Jachath, fis li a; Zimma, fis li a; <verse eid="1CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 6:21" />Joach, fis li a; Iddo, fis li a; Zérach, fis li a; Jeathrai, fis li a. <verse eid="1CH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 6:22" />Fis a Kehath yo: Amminadab, fis li a; Koré, fis li a; Assir, fis li a; <verse eid="1CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 6:23" />Elkana, fis li a; Ebjasap, fis li a; Assir, fis li a; <verse eid="1CH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 6:24" />Thachath, fis li a; Uriel, fis li a; Ozias, fis li a; Saül, fis li a. <verse eid="1CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 6:25" />Fis a Elkana yo: Amasaï avèk Achimoth; <verse eid="1CH 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 6:26" />Elkana, fis li a; Elkana-Tsophaï, fis li a; Nachath, fis li a; <verse eid="1CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 6:27" />Éliab, fis li a; Jerocham, fis li a; Elkana, fis li a; <verse eid="1CH 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 6:28" />epi fis a Samuel yo, premye ne a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:2">I Sam 8:2</ref></char></note>Joel ak Abija. <verse eid="1CH 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 6:29" />Fis a Merari yo: Machli; Libni, fis li a; Schimeï, fis li a; Uzza, fis li a; <verse eid="1CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 6:30" />Schimea, fis li a; Hagguija, fis li a; Asaja, fis li a.<verse eid="1CH 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 6:31" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 15:16-27">I Kwo 15:16-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, sila yo se sila ke David te chwazi nan sèvis chante lakay SENYÈ a, lè lach la te fin poze la. <verse eid="1CH 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 6:32" />Yo te fè ministè avèk chanson yo devan tant tabènak asanble a, jis lè Salomon te fin bati lakay SENYÈ a Jérusalem; epi yo te sèvi nan fonksyon pa yo selon lòd yo. <verse eid="1CH 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 6:33" />Sila yo se sila ki te sèvi avèk fis pa yo: Soti nan fis a Kehathit yo: Héman, chantè a, fis a Joël la, fis a Samuel la, <verse eid="1CH 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 6:34" />fis a Elkana a, fis a Jerocham nan, fis a Éliel la, fis a Thoach la, <verse eid="1CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 6:35" />fis a Tsuph la, fis a Elkana a, fis a Machath la, fis a Amasaï a, <verse eid="1CH 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 6:36" />fis a Elkana a, fis a Joël la, fis a Azaria a, fis a Sophonie a, <verse eid="1CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 6:37" />fis a Thachath la, fis a Assir a, fis a Ebjasaph la, fis a Koré a, <verse eid="1CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 6:38" />fis a Jitsehar la, fis a Kehath la, fis a Lévi a, fis a Israël la. <verse eid="1CH 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 6:39" />Frè Héman an, Asaph te kanpe sou men dwat li, menm Asaph la, fis a Bérékia a, fis a Schimea a, <verse eid="1CH 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 6:40" />fis a Micaël la, fis a Baaséja a, fis a Malkija a, <verse eid="1CH 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 6:41" />fis a Ethni a, fis a Zérach la, fis a Adaja a, <verse eid="1CH 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 6:42" />fis a Éthan an, fis a Zimma a, fis a Schimeï a, <verse eid="1CH 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 6:43" />fis a Jachath la, fis a Guerschom an, fis a Lévi a. <verse eid="1CH 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 6:44" />Sou lamen goch, fanmi pa yo, fis a Merari yo: Ethan, fis a Kishi a, fis a Abdi a, fis a Malluch la, <verse eid="1CH 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 6:45" />fis a Haschabia a, fis a Amatsia a, fis a Hilkija a, <verse eid="1CH 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 6:46" />fis a Amtsi a, fis a Bani a, fis a Schémer a, <verse eid="1CH 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 6:47" />fis a Machli a, fis a Muschi a, fis a Merari a, fis a Lévi a. <verse eid="1CH 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 6:48" />Fanmi pa yo, Levit yo, te chwazi pou tout sèvis tabènak lakay Bondye a. <verse eid="1CH 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 6:49" />Men Aaron avèk fis li yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:1-8">Egz 27:1-8</ref></char></note>lofri sou lotèl ofrann brile a ak sou lotèl lansan an, pou tout zèv kote ki pi sen pase tout lòt yo a e pou fè ekspiyasyon pou Israël, selon tout sa ke Moïse, sèvitè Bondye a, te òdone.<verse eid="1CH 6:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 6:50" />Sila yo se fis a Aaron yo: Éléazar, fis li a; Phinées, fis li a; Abischua, fis li a; <verse eid="1CH 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 6:51" />Bukki, fis li a; Uzzi, fis li a; Zerachja, fis li a; <verse eid="1CH 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 6:52" />Merajoth, fis li a; Amaria, fis li a; Achithub, fis li a; <verse eid="1CH 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 6:53" />Tsadok, fis li a; Achimaats, fis li a. <verse eid="1CH 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 6:54" />Alò, sila yo se lye anplasman pa yo selon kan anndan tout fwontyè yo. A fis Aaron yo, a fanmi Keatit yo, (paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 21:4-10">Jos 21:4-10</ref></char></note>premye tiraj osò a te tonbe pou yo), <verse eid="1CH 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 6:55" />a yo, yo te bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:13">Jos 14:13</ref></char></note>Hébron, nan peyi Juda a ak teren patiraj ki te antoure li a; <verse eid="1CH 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CH 6:56" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:13">Jos 15:13</ref></char></note>men chan vil yo ak bouk pa li yo, yo te bay a Caleb, fis a Jephunné a. <verse eid="1CH 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CH 6:57" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:57 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 21:13-19">Jos 21:13-19</ref></char></note>A fis Aaron yo, yo te bay vil azil sila yo: Hébron, Libna, osi avèk patiraj pa li a, Jatthir, Eschthemoa ak patiraj pa li a, <verse eid="1CH 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CH 6:58" />Hilen avèk patiraj pa li yo, Debir avèk patiraj pa li a, <verse eid="1CH 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1CH 6:59" />Aschan avèk patiraj pa li a ak Beth-Schémesch avèk patiraj pa li a; <verse eid="1CH 6:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1CH 6:60" />epi soti nan tribi Benjamin an, Guéba avèk patiraj pa li a, Aliémeth avèk patiraj pa li a. Tout vil pa yo pami tout fanmi pa yo te trèz vil.<verse eid="1CH 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="1CH 6:61" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:61 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 21:5">Jos 21:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Epi a tout lòt fis a Kehath yo, te bay pa tiraj osò, soti nan fanmi a tribi a, soti nan mwatye tribi a, mwatye tribi Manassé a, dis vil. <verse eid="1CH 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="1CH 6:62" />A fis a Guerschom yo, selon fanmi pa yo, te bay soti nan tribi Issacar ak soti nan tribi Aser a, tribi Nephtali a ak tribi Manassé a, trèz vil nan Basan yo. <verse eid="1CH 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1CH 6:63" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:63 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 21:7-40">Jos 21:7-40</ref></char></note>A fis a Merari yo, te bay pa tiraj osò, selon fanmi pa yo, soti nan tribi Ruben an, tribi Gad la ak tribi Zabulon an, douz vil. <verse eid="1CH 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1CH 6:64" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:1-8">Nonb 35:1-8</ref></char></note>Konsa, fis a Israël yo te bay a Levit yo vil avèk patiraj yo. <verse eid="1CH 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="1CH 6:65" />Yo te bay pa tiraj osò soti nan tribi fis a Juda yo, tribi a fis a Siméon yo ak tribi a fis a Benjamin yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:65 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:57-60">I Kwo 6:57-60</ref></char></note>vil sila ki mansyone pa non yo.<verse eid="1CH 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="1CH 6:66" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:66 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 21:20-26">Jos 21:20-26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, kèk nan fanmi a fis a Kehath yo te gen vil nan teritwa pa yo soti nan tribi Éphraïm. <verse eid="1CH 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="1CH 6:67" />Yo te bay yo vil azil yo kon swivan: Sichem avèk patiraj li nan peyi ti mòn Éphraïm yo avèk patiraj pa li; anplis, Gezer avèk patiraj li yo, <verse eid="1CH 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="1CH 6:68" />Jokmeam avèk patiraj pa li, Beth-Horon avèk patiraj pa li; <verse eid="1CH 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="1CH 6:69" />Ajalon avèk patiraj pa li e Gath-Rimmon avèk patiraj pa li; <verse eid="1CH 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="1CH 6:70" />epi depi nan mwatye tribi Manassé a, Aner ak tè patiraj pa li a, e Bileam ak tè patiraj pa li a, pou rès fanmi a fis Kehath yo.<verse eid="1CH 6:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="1CH 6:71" />A fis Guerschom yo, yo te bay soti nan fanmi a mwatye tribi Manassé a: Golan avèk Basan ak patiraj pa li e Aschtaroth avèk patiraj pa li; <verse eid="1CH 6:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="1CH 6:72" />epi a tribi Issacar a: Kédesch avèk patiraj pa li, Dobrath avèk patiraj pa li, <verse eid="1CH 6:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="1CH 6:73" />Ramoth avèk patiraj pa li e Ahem avèk patiraj li, <verse eid="1CH 6:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="1CH 6:74" />epi soti nan tribi Aser, Maschal avèk patiraj pa li; Abdon avèk patiraj pa li, <verse eid="1CH 6:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="1CH 6:75" />Hukok avèk patiraj pa li e Rehob avèk patiraj pa li; <verse eid="1CH 6:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="1CH 6:76" />epi soti nan tribi Nephthali, Kédesch nan Galilée avèk patiraj pa li, Hammon avèk patiraj pa li e Kir-jathaïm avèk patiraj pa li.<verse eid="1CH 6:76" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="1CH 6:77" />Pou rès nan Levit yo, fis a Merari yo: te resevwa soti nan tribi Zabulon, Rimmono avèk patiraj pa li; <verse eid="1CH 6:77" /><verse number="78" style="v" sid="1CH 6:78" />epi lòtbò Jourdain an nan Jéricho, nan kote lès Jourdain an, te bay a yo menm soti nan tribi Ruben an: Betser nan dezè a avèk patiraj pa li yo ak Jahtsa avèk patiraj pa li, <verse eid="1CH 6:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="1CH 6:79" />Kedémoth avèk patiraj pa li ak Méphaath avèk patiraj pa li; <verse eid="1CH 6:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="1CH 6:80" />epi soti nan tribi a Gad la; te bay Ramoth nan Galaad avèk patiraj pa li, Mahanaïm avèk patiraj pa li, <verse eid="1CH 6:80" /><verse number="81" style="v" sid="1CH 6:81" />Hesbon avè patiraj pa li ak Jaezer avèk patiraj pa li.<verse eid="1CH 6:81" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CH 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 7:1" />Alò, fis a Issacar yo se te kat: Thola, Pua, Jaschub avèk Schimron. <verse eid="1CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 7:2" />Fis a Thola yo te Uzzi, Rephaja, Jeriel, Jachmaï, Jibsam ak Samuel, chèf lakay zansèt pa yo a. Fis a Thola yo te mesye gwo kouraj nan jenerasyon pa yo; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:1-9">II Sam 24:1-9</ref></char></note>fòs kantite yo nan jou a David yo te venn-de-mil-sis-san. <verse eid="1CH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 7:3" />Fis a Uzzi a te Jizrachja. Fis a Jizrachja yo: Micaël, Abdias, Joël, Jischija; tout nan senk sa yo se te moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 5:24">I Kwo 5:24</ref></char></note>chèf yo te ye. <verse eid="1CH 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 7:4" />Avèk yo pa jenerasyon pa yo selon lakay zansèt pa yo, te trann-si-mil sòlda nan lame pou fè lagè, paske yo te gen anpil madanm avèk fis. <verse eid="1CH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 7:5" />Fanmi pa yo pami tout fanmi a Issacar yo te mesye gwo kouraj, anrejistre selon zansèt pa yo; antou, katre-ven-mil sòlda.<verse eid="1CH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 7:6" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 8:1-40">I Kwo 8:1-40</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis a Benjamin yo se te twa: Béla, Béker avèk Jediaël. <verse eid="1CH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 7:7" />Fis Bela yo te senk: Etsbon, Uzzi, Uziel, Jerimoth avèk Iri. Yo te chèf lakay zansèt pa yo, mesye ak gwo kouraj e yo te venn-de-mil-trant-kat anrejistre pa zansèt pa yo. <verse eid="1CH 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 7:8" />Fis a Béker yo: Zemira, Joasch, Éliézer, Eljoénaï, Omri, Jerémoth, Abija, Anathoth avèk Alameth; tout nan senk sa yo te fis a Béker. <verse eid="1CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 7:9" />Yo te anrejistre pa zansèt pa yo selon jenerasyon pa yo, chèf lakay zansèt pa yo, ven-mil-de-san mesye ak gwo kouraj. <verse eid="1CH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 7:10" />Fis a Jediaël la: Bilhan. Fis a Bilhan yo: Jeusch, Benjamin, Éhud, Kenaana, Zéthan, Tarsis ak Achischachar, <verse eid="1CH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 7:11" />Tout sila yo te fis a Jediaël, selon chèf a lakay papa yo, di-sèt mil-de-sant mesye ak gwo kouraj ki te prè pou sòti fè lagè avèk lame a. <verse eid="1CH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 7:12" />Schuppim avèk Huppim te fis a Ir yo; Huschim te fis a Acher a.<verse eid="1CH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 7:13" />Fis a Nephthali yo: Jahtsiel, Guni, Jetser avèk Schallum, fis a Bilha yo.<verse eid="1CH 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 7:14" />Fis a Manassé yo: Asriel, fèt pa ti mennaj Siryen li an; li te fè Makir, papa a Galaad. <verse eid="1CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 7:15" />Makir te pran yon madanm pou Huppim ak Schuppim. Non a sè li a te Maaca. Non a dezyèm fis la te Tselophchad; epi Tselophchad te gen fi. <verse eid="1CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 7:16" />Maaca, madanm a Mamakir a te fè yon fis e te rele li Péresch; non a frè li a te Schéresch e fis pa li yo te Ulam avèk Rékem. <verse eid="1CH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 7:17" />Fis a Ulam la te Bedan. Sila yo te fis a Galaad, fis a Makir a, fis a Manassé a. <verse eid="1CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 7:18" />Sè li, Hammoléketh te fè Ischhod, Abiézer ak Machla. <verse eid="1CH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 7:19" />Fis a Schemida yo te Achjan, Sichem, Likchi ak Aniam.<verse eid="1CH 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 7:20" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 26:35-36">Nonb 26:35-36</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis a Éphraïm yo: Schutélach; Béred, fis pa li; Thachath, fis pa li; Éleada, fis pa li; Thachath, fis pa li; <verse eid="1CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 7:21" />Zabad, fis li; Schutélach, fis li; Ézer avèk Élead ki mesye Gath ki te fèt nan peyi yo te touye, akoz yo te desann pou vòlè bèt yo. <verse eid="1CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 7:22" />Papa yo, Éphraïm te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:34">Jen 37:34</ref></char></note>kriye pandan anpil jou e fanmi li te vini rekonfòte l. <verse eid="1CH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 7:23" />Epi li te vin antre nan madanm li, li te vin ansent, li te fè yon fis e li te bay li non Beria, akoz malè ki te rive lakay li a. <verse eid="1CH 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 7:24" />Fi li a se te Scheera, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 16:3-5">Jos 16:3-5</ref></char></note>ki te bati ni ba ni wo Beth-Horon, avèk Uzzen-Schééra. <verse eid="1CH 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 7:25" />Réphach, fis li a ak Rescheph; Thélach, fis li a; Thachan, fis li a; <verse eid="1CH 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 7:26" />Laedan, fis li a; Ammihud, fis li a; Élischama, fis li a; <verse eid="1CH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 7:27" />Nun, fis li a; Josué, fis li a. <verse eid="1CH 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 7:28" />Teritwa pa yo avèk anplasman pa yo te Béthel avèk vil pa li yo ak nan lès Naaran; nan lwès, Guézer avèk vil pa li yo, Sichem avèk vil pa li yo, jis rive Gaza avèk vil pa li yo e Sichem avèk vil pa li yo jis rive nan Ayya avèk vil pa li yo, <verse eid="1CH 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 7:29" />epi tou, nan longè fwontyè a fis Manassé yo, Beth-Schean avèk vil pa li yo, Thaanac avèk vil pa li yo, Meguiddo avèk vil pa li yo, Dor avèk vil pa li yo. Nan sila yo, te viv <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1:22-29">Jij 1:22-29</ref></char></note>fis a Joseph yo, fis a Israël a.<verse eid="1CH 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 7:30" />Fis a Aser yo: Jimna, Jischiva, Jischvi ak Beria; avèk Sérach, sè yo. <verse eid="1CH 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 7:31" />Fis a Beria yo: Héber avèk Malkiel, ki te papa a Birzaith. <verse eid="1CH 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 7:32" />Héber te vin papa a Japhleth, Schomer avèk Hotham ak Schua, sè yo. <verse eid="1CH 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 7:33" />Fis a Japhleth yo: Pasac, Bimhal ak Aschvath. Sila yo se te fis a Japhleth yo. <verse eid="1CH 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 7:34" />Fis a Schamer yo: Achi, Rohega, Hubba ak Aram. <verse eid="1CH 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 7:35" />Fis a Hélem yo, frè li a: Tsophach, Jimna, Schélèsch ak Amal. <verse eid="1CH 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 7:36" />Fis a Tsophach yo: Suach, Harnépher, Schual, Béri, Jimra, <verse eid="1CH 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 7:37" />Betser, Hod, Schamma, Schilscha, Jithran ak Beéra. <verse eid="1CH 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 7:38" />Fis a Jéther yo: Jephunné, Pispa ak Ara. <verse eid="1CH 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 7:39" />Fis a Ulla yo: Arach, Hanniel ak Ritsja. <verse eid="1CH 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 7:40" />Tout sila yo te fis a Aser, chèf lakay zansèt pa yo, mesye byen chwazi, byen fò e plen ak kouraj, chèf an tèt sou chèf yo. Epi non pa yo anrejistre selon zansèt pa yo, pou sèvis lagè te venn-si-mil òm.<verse eid="1CH 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CH 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 8:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 46:21">Jen 46:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Benjamin te devni papa a Bela, premye ne li a, Ashbel, dezyèm nan, Aharah, twazyèm nan, <verse eid="1CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 8:2" />Nocha, katriyèm nan ak Rapha, senkyèm nan. <verse eid="1CH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 8:3" />Bela te fè fis: Addar, Guéra, Abihud, <verse eid="1CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 8:4" />Abischua, Naaman, Achoach, <verse eid="1CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 8:5" />Guéra, Schephuphan ak Huram. <verse eid="1CH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 8:6" />Men fis a Echud yo, ki te chèf nan fanmi pa yo pami moun Guéba yo e ki te pote an egzil nan Manachath: <verse eid="1CH 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 8:7" />Naaman, Achija ak Guéra. Guéra, sila ki te ale an egzil la, te devni papa a Uzza avèk Achichud.<verse eid="1CH 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 8:8" />Schacharaïm te fè pitit nan peyi Moab lè li te fin fè sòti madanm li yo, Hushim ak Baara. <verse eid="1CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 8:9" />Avèk Hodesch, madanm li an, li te devni papa a Jobab, Tsibja, Méscha, Malcam, <verse eid="1CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 8:10" />Jeuts, Schocja ak Mirma. Sila yo se te fis li yo, chèf lakay zansèt pa yo <verse eid="1CH 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 8:11" />Pa Huschim, li menm Schacharaïm te vin papa Abithub avèk Eipaal. <verse eid="1CH 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 8:12" />Fis a Elpaal yo: Éber, Mischeam, avèk Schémer, ki te bati Ono avèk Lod avèk vil pa li yo; <verse eid="1CH 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 8:13" />epi Beria avèk Schéma, ki te chèf lakay fanmi zansèt pa yo pami moun Ajalon yo, ki te fè moun Gath yo sove ale, <verse eid="1CH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 8:14" />epi Achjo, Schaschak, Jerémpoth, <verse eid="1CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 8:15" />Zebadja, Arad, Éder, <verse eid="1CH 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 8:16" />Micaël, Jischpha avèk Jocha te fis a Beria. <verse eid="1CH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 8:17" />Zebadja, Meschullam, Hizki, Héber, <verse eid="1CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 8:18" />Jischmeraï, Jizlia avèk Jobab te fis a Elpaal. <verse eid="1CH 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 8:19" />Jakim, Zicri, Zabdi, <verse eid="1CH 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 8:20" />Éliénaï, Tsilthaï, Éliel, <verse eid="1CH 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 8:21" />Adaja, Beraja ak Schimrath te fis a Shimei. <verse eid="1CH 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 8:22" />Jischpan, Éber, Éliel, <verse eid="1CH 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 8:23" />Abdon, Zicri, Hanan, <verse eid="1CH 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 8:24" />Hananja, Élam, Anthothija, <verse eid="1CH 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 8:25" />Jiphdeja avèk Penuel te fis a Schaschak. <verse eid="1CH 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 8:26" />Schamscheraï, Schecharia, Athalia, <verse eid="1CH 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 8:27" />Jaaréschia, Élija ak Zicri te fis a Jerocham. <verse eid="1CH 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 8:28" />Sila yo se te chèf a fanmi zansèt pa yo selon jenerasyon pa yo, chèf ki te rete Jérusalem yo,<verse eid="1CH 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 8:29" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 9:35-38">I Kwo 9:35-38</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, nan Gabaon, te rete Jeiel, papa a Gabaon an e madanm li te rele Maaca; <verse eid="1CH 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 8:30" />epi fis premye ne pa l la se te Abdon ak Tsus, Kis, Baal, Nadab, <verse eid="1CH 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 8:31" />Guedor, Achjo ak Jéker. <verse eid="1CH 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 8:32" />Mikloth te fè Schimea. Yo menm tou te rete Jérusalem avèk fanmi pa yo anfas lòt moun fanmi pa yo. <verse eid="1CH 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 8:33" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:39-44">I Kwo 9:39-44</ref></char></note>Ner te vin papa a Kis e Kis te vin papa a Saül: Saül te vin papa a Jonathan, Malki-Schua, Abinadab ak Eschbaal. <verse eid="1CH 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 8:34" />Fis a Jonathan yo: Merib-Baal. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:12">II Sam 9:12</ref></char></note>Merib-Baal te fè Michée. <verse eid="1CH 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 8:35" />Fis a Michée yo: Pithon, Mélec, Thaeréa avèk Achaz. <verse eid="1CH 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 8:36" />Achaz te fè Jehoadda; Jehoadda te fè Alémeth, Azmaveth avèk Zimri; Zimri te fè Motsa; <verse eid="1CH 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 8:37" />Motsa te fè Binea. Rapha te fis pa li; Éleasa, fis pa li a, Atsel, fis pa li a; <verse eid="1CH 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 8:38" />Atsel te fè sis fis; men non yo: Azrikam, Bocru, Ismaël, Schearia, Abdias avèk Hanan. Tout sa yo se te fis a Atsel yo. <verse eid="1CH 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 8:39" />Fis a Éschek yo, frè li a: Ulam, premye ne li a, Jeusch, dezyèm nan ak Éliphéleth, twazyèm nan. <verse eid="1CH 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 8:40" />Fis a Ulam yo te mesye pwisan, ranpli ak kouraj, achè yo, avèk anpil fis e fis a fis, san-senkant antou. Tout sa yo se te fis a Benjamin.<verse eid="1CH 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CH 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 9:1" />Konsa, tout Israël te anrejistre pa zansèt yo; epi men vwala, yo ekri nan Liv Wa A Israël yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 5:25-26">I Kwo 5:25-26</ref></char></note>Epi Juda te pote ale an egzil Babylone, akoz enfidelite li yo. <verse eid="1CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 9:2" />Premye moun ki te vin abite ankò nan teritwa sila yo, nan vil pa yo, se te Israël, prèt Levit yo ak sèvitè tanp yo. <verse eid="1CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 9:3" />Kèk nan fis Juda yo, nan fis Benjamin yo ak nan fis a Éphraïm yo avèk Manasée te rete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 11:1">Né 11:1</ref></char></note>Jérusalem: <verse eid="1CH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 9:4" />Uthaï, fis a Ammihud la, fis a Omri a, fis a Imri a, fis a Bani a, soti nan fis Pérets yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:12">Jen 46:12</ref></char></note>fis a Juda a, <verse eid="1CH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 9:5" />Soti nan Shilonit yo: Asaja, premye ne a avèk fis li yo. <verse eid="1CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 9:6" />Soti nan fis Zérach yo: Jeuel, avèk moun fanmi li yo, sis-san-katre-ven-dis nan yo. <verse eid="1CH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 9:7" />Soti nan fis Benjamin yo: Sallu, fis a Meschullam nan, fis a Hodavia a, fis a Assenua a; <verse eid="1CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 9:8" />epi Jibneja, fis a Jerocham nan; Éla, fis a Uzzi a, fis a Micri a; epi Meschullam, fis a Schephathia a, fis a Reuel la, fis a Jibnija a; <verse eid="1CH 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 9:9" />avèk fanmi pa yo selon zansèt pa yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 11:8">Né 11:8</ref></char></note>nèf-san-senkant-sis. Tout sila yo se te chèf lakay zansèt pa yo selon lakay papa yo.<verse eid="1CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 9:10" />Soti nan prèt yo te: Jedaeja, Jehorjarib, Jakin; <verse eid="1CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 9:11" />Azaria, fis a Hilkija a, fis a Meschullam nan, fis a Tsadok la, fis a Merajoth la, fis a Achithub la, chèf lakay Bondye a; <verse eid="1CH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 9:12" />Addaja, fis a Jerocham nan, fis a Paschur a, fis a Malkija a; Maesaï, fis a Adiel la, fis a Jachzéra a, fis a Meschullam nan, fis a Meschillémith la, fis a Immer a; <verse eid="1CH 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 9:13" />epi fanmi pa yo, chèf lakay zansèt pa yo, mil-sèt-san-swasant, mesye ak gwo kapasite pou lèv lakay Bondye a.<verse eid="1CH 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 9:14" />Nan Levit yo: Schemaeja, fis a Haschub la, fis a Azrikam nan, fis a Haschabia a, fis a Merari yo; <verse eid="1CH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 9:15" />Bakbakkar, Héresch, Galal, Matthania, fis a Michée a, fis a Zicri a, fis a Asaph la; <verse eid="1CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 9:16" />Abdias, fis a Schemaeja a, fis a Galal la, fis a Jeduthun nan ak Bérékia, fis a Asa a, fis a Elkana a, ki te rete nan vil Netofatyen yo.<verse eid="1CH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 9:17" />Alò, gadyen pòtay yo te Schallum, Akkub, Thalmon, Achiman avèk fanmi pa yo (Schallum, ki te chèf la, <verse eid="1CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 9:18" />estasyone jis koulye a nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:1">Éz 44:1</ref></char></note>pòtay wa a nan kote lès la). Sila yo te gadyen pòtay pou kan a fis a Lévi yo. <verse eid="1CH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 9:19" />Schallum, fis a Koré a, fis a Ébiasaph la, fis a Koré a, avèk fanmi lakay papa li, Koatit yo: responsab pou travay sèvis la, gadyen nan pòtay nan tant yo; epi papa yo te konn sou kan SENYÈ a; li te gadyen a antre a. <verse eid="1CH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 9:20" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:7-13">Nonb 25:7-13</ref></char></note>Phinées, fis a Éléazar a, oparavan te konn chèf sou yo; epi SENYÈ a te avèk li. <verse eid="1CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 9:21" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 26:2-14">I Kwo 26:2-14</ref></char></note>Zacharie, fis a Meschélémia a, te gadyen pòtay a antre tant asanble a. <verse eid="1CH 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 9:22" />Total nan sila ki te chwazi kon gadyen pòtay nan pòt yo te de-san-douz. Sila yo te anrejistre pa zansèt pa yo nan vil pa yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 26:1">I Kwo 26:1</ref></char></note>ki te chwazi pa David avèk Samuel, konseye a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 31:15-18">II Kwo 31:15-18</ref></char></note>nan pozisyon konfyans sila a. <verse eid="1CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 9:23" />Konsa, yo menm avèk fis pa yo te responsab pòtay lakay SENYÈ a, lakay tant lan, kon gadyen. <verse eid="1CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 9:24" />Gadyen pòtay yo te sou toule kat kote yo, nan lès, lwès, nan nò ak nan sid. <verse eid="1CH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 9:25" />Manm fanmi pa yo nan lavil pa yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 11:5-7">II Wa 11:5-7</ref> </char></note>te dwe antre chak sèt jou soti de tanzantan pou yo ta kapab avèk yo; <verse eid="1CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 9:26" />paske kat chèf gadyen pòtay ki te Levit yo, te nan yon pozisyon konfyans lan e te sou chanm yo ak sou trezò lakay Bondye a. <verse eid="1CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 9:27" />Yo te pase nwit lan nan landwa lakay Bondye a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:30-32">I Kwo 23:30-32</ref> </char></note>akoz yo te responsab veye nwit lan; epi yo te responsab ouvri li maten pa maten.<verse eid="1CH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 9:28" />Alò, kèk nan yo te an chaj zouti sèvis yo; paske yo te kontwole yo lè yo te mennen yo antre ak lè yo te sòti. <verse eid="1CH 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 9:29" />Anplis, kèk nan yo te chwazi mèb ak tout zouti sanktiyè a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:29">I Kwo 23:29</ref> </char></note>sou farin fen an, diven an, lwil la ak lansan an avèk epis yo.<verse eid="1CH 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 9:30" />Kèk nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:23-35">Egz 30:23-35</ref></char></note>fis a prèt yo te prepare melanj epis yo. <verse eid="1CH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 9:31" />Matthithia, youn nan Levit yo, premye ne a Schallum nan, Koatit la, te responsab bay yo sa ki te kwit nan kivèt yo. <verse eid="1CH 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 9:32" />Epi kèk nan fanmi a fis Koatit yo te sou pen konsakre a pou prepare li pou chak Saba.<verse eid="1CH 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 9:33" />Alò, sila yo se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:31-47">I Kwo 6:31-47</ref></char></note>chantè yo a Levit yo, ki te rete nan chanm tanp yo, pwiske yo te angaje nan travay pa yo lajounen kon lannwit. <verse eid="1CH 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 9:34" />Sila yo te chèf a lakay zansèt yo pami Levit yo selon jenerasyon pa yo, mesye dirijan ki te rete Jérusalem yo.<verse eid="1CH 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 9:35" />Jeïel, papa a Gabaon an te rete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 8:29-32">I Kwo 8:29-32</ref></char></note>Gabaon e madanm li te rele Maacah, <verse eid="1CH 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 9:36" />epi premye ne li a te Abdon ak Tsur, Kis, Baal, Ner, Nadab, <verse eid="1CH 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 9:37" />Guedor, Achjo, Zacharie ak Mikoth. <verse eid="1CH 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 9:38" />Mikloth te fè Schimeam. Epi yo menm tou te rete avèk fanmi pa yo Jérusalem anfas fanmi pa yo. <verse eid="1CH 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 9:39" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 8:33-38">I Kwo 8:33-38</ref></char></note>Ner te vin papa a Kish, Kish te vin papa a Saül. Saül te vin papa a Jonathan, Malki-Schua, Abinadab ak Eschbaal. <verse eid="1CH 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 9:40" />Fis a Jonathan an: Merib-Baal. Merib-Baal te vin papa a Michée. <verse eid="1CH 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 9:41" />Fis a Michée yo: Pithon, Mélec ak Thachréa. <verse eid="1CH 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 9:42" />Achaz te fè Jaera; Jaera te fè Alémeth, Azmaveth ak Zimri; Zimri te fè Motsa; Motsa te fè Binea. <verse eid="1CH 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 9:43" />Motsa te vin papa a Rephaja; Éleasa, fis li a; Arsel, fis li a. <verse eid="1CH 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 9:44" />Atsel te fè sis fis; men non yo: Azrikam, Bocru, Ismaël, Schearia, Abidias avèk Hanan. Sila yo se te fis a Atsel yo.<verse eid="1CH 9:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CH 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 10:1" />Alò, Filisten yo te goumen kont Israël; epi mesye Israël yo te sove ale devan Filisten yo e te mouri sou Mòn Guilboa. <verse eid="1CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 10:2" />Filisten yo te kouri prese dèyè Saül avèk fis li yo, e Filisten yo te touye Jonathan, Abinadab ak Malki-Schua, fis a Saül yo. <verse eid="1CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 10:3" />Batay la te vin rèd kont Saül e ekip banza yo te rive sou li. Konsa li te blese pa ekip banza yo. <verse eid="1CH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 10:4" />Alò, Saül te di a sila ki te pote zam li yo: “Rale nepe ou e frennen m nèt avè l pou ensikonsi sila yo pa vin abize mwen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 10:4">Men pòtè zam li yo pa t fè l, paske li te krent anpil. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 31:4">I Sam 31:4</ref></char></note>Pou sa, Saül te pran nepe li e te tonbe sou li. <verse eid="1CH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 10:5" />Lè pòtè zam li an te wè ke li te mouri, li menm tou te tonbe sou nepe li e te mouri. <verse eid="1CH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 10:6" />Konsa, Saul te mouri avèk twa fis li yo, e tout lakay li te mouri ansanm. <verse eid="1CH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 10:7" />Lè tout mesye Israël ki te nan vale yo, te wè ke yo te sove ale, e ke Saül avèk fis li yo te mouri, yo te sove ale kite vil yo. Epi Filisten yo te vin rete ladan yo.<verse eid="1CH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 10:8" />Li te vin rive nan pwochen jou a, lè Filisten yo te vini pou depouye mò yo, ke yo te twouve Saül avèk fis li yo tonbe sou Mòn Guilboa a. <verse eid="1CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 10:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 31:9">I Sam 31:9</ref></char></note>Konsa, yo te depouye li e te pran tèt li avèk zam avèk boukliye li yo e te voye mesaje antoure tout peyi Filisten yo pou pote bòn nouvèl la rive nan zidòl pa yo avèk pèp la. <verse eid="1CH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 10:10" />Yo te mete zam avèk boukliye li yo lakay dye pa yo e te tache kolè tèt li lakay Dagon an. <verse eid="1CH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 10:11" />Lè tout moun Jabès-Galaad yo te tande tout sa ke Filisten yo te fè a Saül, <verse eid="1CH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 10:12" />tout mesye gwo kouraj yo te leve e pran kò a Saül avèk kò a fis li yo pou te pote yo Jabès, yo te antere yo anba chenn nan Jabès e te fè jèn pandan sèt jou.<verse eid="1CH 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 10:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 13:13-14">I Sam 13:13-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, Saül te mouri pou mal ke li te fè kont SENYÈ a, akoz pawòl a SENYÈ a ke li pa t kenbe; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:31">Lev 19:31</ref></char></note>osi, paske li te fè demand a youn nan sila ki pale ak mò yo, pou mande konsèy, <verse eid="1CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 10:14" />epi pa t mande konsèy a SENYÈ a. Pou sa, Li te touye li, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:28">I Sam 15:28</ref></char></note>bay wayòm nan a David, fis a Jesse a.<verse eid="1CH 10:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CH 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 11:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 5:1-10">II Sam 5:1-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Epi tout Israël te reyini kote David nan Hébron. Yo te di: “Gade byen, nou se zo ou ak chè ou. <verse eid="1CH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 11:2" />Nan tan pase yo, menm lè Saül te wa, se te ou menm ki te mennen Israël sòti ak antre. Epi konsa, SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, te di ou: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:2">II Sam 5:2</ref></char></note>‘Ou va bèje pèp Israël Mwen an, e ou va Prens sou pèp Mwen an, Israël.’”<verse eid="1CH 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 11:3" />Pou sa, tout ansyen nan Israël yo te vin kote wa a Hébron e David te fè yon akò avèk yo Hébron devan SENYÈ a. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:3-5">II Sam 5:3-5</ref></char></note>yo te onksyone David Wa sou Israël, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:1-13">I Sam 16:1-13</ref></char></note>selon pawòl SENYÈ a te pwononse pa Samuel la.<verse eid="1CH 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 11:4" />Konsa, David, avèk tout Israël te ale Jérusalem (sa vle di, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:8-63">Jos 15:8-63</ref></char></note>Jébus). Jebizyen ki te abite nan peyi yo te la. <verse eid="1CH 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 11:5" />Pèp Jébus la te di a David: “Ou p ap antre isit la.” Malgre sa, David te kaptire fò a Sion an (sa vle di, vil David la). <verse eid="1CH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 11:6" />Alò, David te pale avan: “Nenpòt moun ki touye yon Jebizyen avan, se li k ap chèf e kòmandan.” Se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:16">II Sam 8:16</ref></char></note>Joab, fis a Tseruja a ki te monte avan; konsa li te devni chèf. <verse eid="1CH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 11:7" />Answit, David te rete nan fò a; pou sa, li te vin rele lavil David la. <verse eid="1CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 11:8" />Li te bati vil toutotou li, soti nan Millo menm pou rive nan tout zòn ki te antoure li yo; epi Joab te repare tout rès vil la. <verse eid="1CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 11:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:1">II Sam 3:1</ref></char></note>David te vin pi gran e pi gran, paske SENYÈ a dèzame yo te avèk li.<verse eid="1CH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 11:10" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 23:8-39">II Sam 23:8-39</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, sila yo se chèf an tèt yo, mesye gran pwisans ke David te genyen yo, ki te bay li soutyen fò nan wayòm li a, pou fè l vin wa, selon pawòl a SENYÈ a pa Israël.<verse eid="1CH 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 11:11" />Sila yo se chif a mesye gran pwisans ke David te genyen yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 23:8">II Sam 23:8</ref></char></note>Jaschobeam, fis a yon Akmoni, chèf a trant lan. Li te parèt ak yon sèl lans devan twa-san òm e te touye tout yon sèl kou. <verse eid="1CH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 11:12" />Apre li, se te Éléazar, fis a Dodo a, Achochit la, youn nan twa prensipal mesye pwisan yo. <verse eid="1CH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 11:13" />Li te avèk David nan Pas-Damimim <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 23:11-12">II Sam 23:11-12</ref> </char></note>lè Filisten yo te rasanble ansanm la pou batay e te gen yon mòso tè plen avèk lòj; epi pèp la te sove ale devan Filisten yo. <verse eid="1CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 11:14" />Yo te kanpe pran plas yo nan mitan mòso tè a pou te defann li e li te touye Filisten yo; epi SENYÈ a te delivre yo avèk yon gran viktwa.<verse eid="1CH 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 11:15" />Alò, twa nan trant mesye chèf yo te desann vè wòch kav Adullam nan, pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 14:9">I Kwo 14:9</ref></char></note>lame Filisten yo t ap fè kan nan vale Rephaïm nan. <verse eid="1CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 11:16" />Konsa, David te anndan fò a pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:5">I Sam 10:5</ref></char></note>lame Filisten an te Bethléem. <verse eid="1CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 11:17" />David te gen yon lanvi, epi te di: “O ke yon moun ban m dlo pou bwè soti nan pwi Bethléem ki akote pòtay la!”<verse eid="1CH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 11:18" />Konsa, twa mesye sa yo te antre nan kan Filisten yo, te rale dlo soti nan pwi Bethléem ki te akote pòtay la e te pran li pou te pote l bay David. Sepandan, David te refize bwè l, men te vide li bay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="1CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 11:19" />Konsa, li te di: “Lwen de mwen devan Bondye mwen an pou m ta fè sa. Èske mwen ta bwè san a mesye sila yo ki te riske lavi yo? Paske se avèk gwo danjè lavi yo menm ke yo te pote li.” Pou sa, li te refize bwè l. Se bagay sila yo ke twa mesye pwisan yo te fè.<verse eid="1CH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 11:20" />Epi Abischaï, frè a Joab la te chèf a trant yo ke li te ye e li te voye lans li kont twa san moun e te touye yo. Li te rekonèt menm jan kon trant yo. <verse eid="1CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 11:21" />Nan trant yo se te li ki te pi rekonèt e te devni kòmandan pa yo; men li pa t rive nan nivo a twa sila yo.<verse eid="1CH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 11:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 8:18">II Sam 8:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Benaja, fis a Jehojada a, fis a yon mesye gwo kouraj nan Kabtseel, pwisan nan zèv li yo, te frape touye de fis a Ariël yo, Moabit la. Anplis, li te desann touye yon lyon anndan yon fòs nan yon jou ke lanèj t ap tonbe. <verse eid="1CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 11:23" />Li te touye yon Ejipsyen, yon nonm gran wotè a senk koude. Alò, nan men Ejipsyen an, te gen yon lans tankou shaf a aparèy tise a; men li te desann kote li avèk yon baton, te sezi lans lan soti nan men Ejipsyen an e te touye li avèk pwòp lans pa li a. <verse eid="1CH 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 11:24" />Bagay sa yo Benaja, fis a Jehojada a te fè e te byen koni menm jan ak twa mesye pwisan yo. <verse eid="1CH 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 11:25" />Gade byen, li te byen onore pami trant yo, men li pa t rive nan nivo a twa sila yo. Konsa, David te apwente l sou gad pa li.<verse eid="1CH 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 11:26" />Alò, mesye pwisan lame yo te Asaël, frè Joab, Elchanan, fis a Dodo nan Bethléem, <verse eid="1CH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 11:27" />Schammoth, Aworit la, Hélets, Palonit la, <verse eid="1CH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 11:28" />Ira, fis a Ikkesch la, Tekoatyen an, Abiézer, Anatotit la. <verse eid="1CH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 11:29" />Sibbecaï, Oushatit la, Ilaï, Achoachit la, <verse eid="1CH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 11:30" />Maharaï, Netofayit la, Héled, fis a Baana a, Netofayit la, <verse eid="1CH 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 11:31" />Ithaï, fis a Ribaï a, Gibityen ki sòti nan fis a Benjamin yo, Benaja ak Pirathon. <verse eid="1CH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 11:32" />Huraï a ti dlo a Gaash yo, Abie ak Araba. <verse eid="1CH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 11:33" />Azmaveth, Bacharumit la, Éliachba, Shaalbonit lan, <verse eid="1CH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 11:34" />Bené-Hasdchem, Gizonit lan, Jonathan, fis a Schagué a, Ararit la. <verse eid="1CH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 11:35" />Achiam, fis a Sacar a, Ararit la, Éliphal, fis a Ur a, <verse eid="1CH 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 11:36" />Hépher, a Mekeratit la, Achija, Palonit lan, <verse eid="1CH 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 11:37" />Hetsro, Kamelit la, Naaraï, fis a Ebzaï a. <verse eid="1CH 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 11:38" />Joël, frè a Nathan an, Mibchar, fis a Hagri a, <verse eid="1CH 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 11:39" />Tsélek, Amonit lan, Nachraï, Bewotit ki te pote zam pou Joab yo, fis a Tseruja a. <verse eid="1CH 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 11:40" />Ira, Jeterit la, Gareb, Jeterit la, <verse eid="1CH 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 11:41" />Urie, Etyen an, Zabad, fis a Achlaï a. <verse eid="1CH 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 11:42" />Adina, fis a Schiza a, Ribenit lan, chèf a Ribenit yo ak trant ki te avè l yo. <verse eid="1CH 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 11:43" />Hanan, fis a Maaca a, Josaphat, Mitnit lan, <verse eid="1CH 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 11:44" />Ozias, Ashtawotit la, Schama avèk Jehiel, fis a Hotham yo, Awoerit la, <verse eid="1CH 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 11:45" />Jediaël, fis a Schimri a, Jocha, frè li, Titsit la, <verse eid="1CH 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 11:46" />Éliel, Machavimit lan, Jeribaï avèk Joschavia, fis a Elnaam yo, Jithma, Moabit la, <verse eid="1CH 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 11:47" />Éliel, Obed ak Jaasiel-Metsobaja.<verse eid="1CH 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CH 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 12:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 27:2-6">I Sam 27:2-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, sila yo se sila ki te vin kote David Tsiklag yo, lè li te toujou jennen akoz Saül, fis a Kish la. Yo te pami mesye pwisan ki te ede nan gè yo. <verse eid="1CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 12:2" />Yo te pote banza, te voye wòch avèk fistibal ni sou men dwat, ni sou men goch, e tire flèch yo ak banza a. Se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 12:29">I Kwo 12:29</ref></char></note>fanmi a Saul, soti nan tribi Benjamin an. <verse eid="1CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 12:3" />Chèf la te Achiézer, swivi pa Joas, fis a Schemaa a, Gibeonit lan; Jeziel ak Péleth, fis a Azmaveth yo; epi Beraca; Jéhu, Anatotit la; <verse eid="1CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 12:4" />Jischmaeia, Gabaonit lan, yon mesye pwisan pami trant yo, e tèt a trant yo, epi Jérémie; Jachaziel; Jochannan'; Jozabad, Guedérait la; <verse eid="1CH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 12:5" />Éluzaï; Jerimoth; Bealia; Schemaria; Schephathia, Awofit la; <verse eid="1CH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 12:6" />Elkana, Jeschija, Azareel, Joézer ak Jaschobeam, Koreyit yo; <verse eid="1CH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 12:7" />ak Joéla avèk Zebadia, fis a Jerocham yo, Gedorit la.<verse eid="1CH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 12:8" />Soti nan Gadit yo, te antre rive kote David nan fò dezè a, mesye pwisan avèk anpil kouraj ki te fè antrenman pou fè lagè, ki te konn manyen boukliye avèk lans, avèk figi yo tankou figi a lyon, e yo vit tankou antilòp nan mòn. <verse eid="1CH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 12:9" />Ézer, chèf la, Abdias, dezyèm nan, Éliab, twazyèm nan, <verse eid="1CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 12:10" />Mischmanna, katriyèm nan, Jérémie, senkyèm nan, <verse eid="1CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 12:11" />Attaï, sizyèm nan, Éliel, setyèm nan, <verse eid="1CH 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 12:12" />Jochanan, uityèm nan, Elzabad, nevyèm nan, <verse eid="1CH 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 12:13" />Jérémie, dizyèm nan, Macbannaï, onzyèm nan. <verse eid="1CH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 12:14" />Sila yo se fis a Gad ki te kapitèn lame a; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:30">Det 32:30</ref></char></note>sila ki te pi piti a te egal a yon santèn moun e pifò a, a yon milye. <verse eid="1CH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 12:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:15">Jos 3:15</ref></char></note>Sila yo se sila ki te travèse Jourdain an nan premye mwa lè tout bò rivyè li yo t ap debòde yo. Yo te chase fè pran flit tout sila ki te nan vale yo, nan lès ak nan lwès.<verse eid="1CH 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 12:16" />Konsa, kèk nan fis a Benjamin yo te vin rive nan fò a David la. <verse eid="1CH 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 12:17" />David te sòti pou rankontre yo. Li te di yo: “Si se nan lapè nou vin kote mwen, pou ede m, kè m va reyini ansanm avèk nou. Men si se pou trayi mwen a advèsè mwen yo, akoz nanpwen mal nan men m, ke Bondye a zansèt nou yo gade sou sa pou deside.” <verse eid="1CH 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 12:18" />Alò, Lespri a te vini sou Amasaï, ki te chèf a trant yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">“Nou se pa w, O David,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">Epi avèk ou, O fis a Jesse a!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">Lapè, lapè a ou menm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">Epi lapè avèk sila ki ede ou!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">Anverite, Bondye ou a ap ede ou!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 12:18">Konsa David te resevwa yo e te fè yo kapitèn nan ekip la.<verse eid="1CH 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 12:19" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 29:2-9">I Sam 29:2-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Soti nan Manassé, osi, kèk moun te vin jwenn David lè li t ap prepare fè batay avèk Filisten yo kont Saül. Men yo pa t ede yo, paske chèf Filisten apre yo te konsilte ansanm, e te voye li ale. Yo te di: “Avèk pri a pwòp tèt nou, li kapab fè defo a mèt li, Saul.”<verse eid="1CH 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 12:20" />Lè l te ale Tsiklag, men moun Manassé ki te parèt yo: Adnach, Jozabad, Jediaël, Micaël, Jozabad, Élihu ak Tsilthaï, chèf a dè milye nan Manassé yo. <verse eid="1CH 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 12:21" />Yo te ede David kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 30:1">I Sam 30:1</ref></char></note>bann piyajè yo, paske yo tout te mesye pwisan, plen ak kouraj e te kapitèn nan lame a. <verse eid="1CH 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 12:22" />Paske jou apre jou, moun te vin kote David pou ede l, jiskaske te gen yon gwo lame <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:2">Jen 32:2</ref></char></note>tankou lame Bondye a.<verse eid="1CH 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 12:23" />Alò sila yo se nonb nan divizyon ki te prepare pou fè lagè a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 2:3-4">II Sam 2:3-4</ref></char></note> nonb ki te vin kote David Hébron pou vire wayòm Saul vè li menm, selon pawòl a SENYÈ a. <verse eid="1CH 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 12:24" />Fis a Juda ki te pote boukliye avèk lans yo te si-mil-ui-san, byen prepare pou fè lagè. <verse eid="1CH 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 12:25" />Nan fis a Siméon yo, mesye plen ak kouraj pou fè lagè yo, sèt-mil-san. <verse eid="1CH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 12:26" />Nan fis a Lévi yo, kat-mil-sis-san. <verse eid="1CH 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 12:27" />Alò, Jehojada, prens lakay Aaron an e avèk li, te gen twa-mil-sèt-san, <verse eid="1CH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 12:28" />anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:17">II Sam 8:17</ref></char></note>Tsadok, gèrye plen ak kouraj la e lakay papa l te gen venn-de kapitèn. <verse eid="1CH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 12:29" />Nan fis Benjamin yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 12:2">I Kwo 12:2</ref></char></note>fanmi a Saül la, twa-mil, paske jis moman sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 2:8-9">II Sam 2:8-9</ref></char></note>pifò nan yo te rete fidèl a lakay Saul. <verse eid="1CH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 12:30" />Nan fis Éphraïm yo, ven-mil-ui-san mesye pwisan avèk anpil kouraj, byen koni lakay zansèt pa yo. <verse eid="1CH 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 12:31" />Nan mwatye tribi Manassé a, diz-ui-mil ki te enskri pa non pou vin fè David wa. <verse eid="1CH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 12:32" />Nan fis a Issacar yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:13">Est 1:13</ref></char></note>mesye ki te konprann tan yo, avèk konesans a sa ke Israël ta dwe fè, chèf pa yo te de-san; epi tout fanmi yo te sou kòmann pa yo. <verse eid="1CH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 12:33" />Nan Zabulon, te gen senkant-mil moun ki te parèt nan lame a ki te konn ranje kò yo nan fòmasyon batay avèk tout kalite zam lagè pou te ede David avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 12:2">Sòm 12:2</ref></char></note>kè ki pa t divize menm. <verse eid="1CH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 12:34" />Nan Nephthali, te gen mil kapitèn e trant-sèt-mil ladann te gen boukliye avèk lans. <verse eid="1CH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 12:35" />Nan Danit ki ta kab ranje nan fòmasyon batay yo, te gen venn-tui-mil-sis-san. <verse eid="1CH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 12:36" />Nan Aser, te gen karant-mil ki te sòti nan lame a pou ranje yo nan fòmasyon batay la. <verse eid="1CH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 12:37" />Soti lòtbò Jourdain an, pa Ribenit ak Gadit yo, avèk mwatye tribi Manassé a, te gen san-ven-mil avèk tout zam lagè pou batay la.<verse eid="1CH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 12:38" />Tout sila yo, mesye lagè ki te konn ranje nan fòmasyon batay yo, te vini Hébron avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:1-13">II Sam 5:1-13</ref></char></note>yon sèl kè sensè pou fè David wa. <verse eid="1CH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 12:39" />Yo te la pandan twa jou. Yo t ap manje ak bwè, paske fanmi pa yo te gen tan prepare pou yo. <verse eid="1CH 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 12:40" />Anplis, sila ki te toupre yo, menm rive lwen tankou Issacar, Zabulon ak Nephthali, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:18">I Sam 25:18</ref></char></note>pote manje sou bourik yo, chamo yo, milèt yo, avèk bèf yo, gran kantite a gato farin, gato fig etranje, anpil rezen, diven, lwil, bèf avèk mouton. Vrèman, te gen lajwa an Israël.<verse eid="1CH 12:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CH 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 13:1" />Alò, David te fè konsèy ansanm avèk kapitèn a dè milye a dè santèn, menm avèk chak chèf. <verse eid="1CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 13:2" />David te di a tout asanble Israël la: “Si li sanble bon a nou menm e si li soti nan SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, annou voye toupatou mesaje a fanmi pa nou ki rete nan peyi Israël yo e osi, a prèt avèk Levit ki avèk yo nan vil pa yo, avèk teren pa yo, pou yo kapab reyini ansanm avèk nou. <verse eid="1CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 13:3" />Konsa, annou pote tounen lach Bondye pa nou an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 7:1-2">I Sam 7:1-2</ref></char></note>paske nan jou Saül yo, nou pa t chache li.”<verse eid="1CH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 13:4" />Alò, tout asanble a te di ke yo ta fè l, paske bagay la te bon nan zye a tout pèp la. <verse eid="1CH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 13:5" />Konsa, David te rasanble tout Israël ansanm, soti nan Sichor nan Egypte jis rive nan antre Hamath, pou pote lach Bondye a soti Kirjath-Jearim.<verse eid="1CH 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 13:6" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 6:2-11">II Sam 6:2-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>David avèk tout Israël te monte Baalah, sa vle di nan Kirjath-Jearim, ki apatyen a Juda, pou pote monte soti la, lach Bondye a, SENYÈ a, ki sou twòn li antre cheriben yo, kote non Li ap rele a. <verse eid="1CH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 13:7" />Yo te pote lach Bondye a sou yon kabwèt nèf soti lakay Abinadab, Uzza avèk Achjo te kondwi kabwèt la. <verse eid="1CH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 13:8" />David avèk tout Israël t ap selebre devan Bondye avèk tout fòs yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:16">I Kwo 15:16</ref></char></note>menm avèk chan, avèk gita yo, ap yo, tanbouren yo, senbal yo ak twonpèt yo.<verse eid="1CH 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 13:9" />Lè yo te rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:6">II Sam 6:6</ref></char></note>glasi vannen an nan Cidon, Uzza te lonje men l pou bay soutyen a lach la akoz bèf yo te prèt pou chavire l. <verse eid="1CH 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 13:10" />Lakòlè SENYÈ a te brile kont Uzza e Li te frape li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:13-15">I Kwo 15:13-15</ref></char></note>akoz li te lonje men l vè lach la; epi li te mouri la devan Bondye. <verse eid="1CH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 13:11" />Konsa, David te vin fache akoz kòlè SENYÈ a te pete kont Uzza. Li te rele plas sa a Pérets-Uzza jis rive jodi a. <verse eid="1CH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 13:12" />David te krent Bondye nan jou sa a, epi te di: “Kijan mwen kapab pote lach Bondye lakay mwen?” <verse eid="1CH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 13:13" />Pou sa, David pa t pran lach la avèk li lavil David, men te pran l sou kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:25">I Kwo 15:25</ref></char></note>kay Obed-Édom an nan Gath. <verse eid="1CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 13:14" />Konsa, lach Bondye a te rete avèk fanmi a Obed-Édom lakay li pandan twa mwa. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 26:4-5">I Kwo 26:4-5</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te beni fanmi Obed-Édom an avèk tout sa li te genyen.<verse eid="1CH 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CH 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 14:1" />Alò Hiram, wa Tyr a, te voye mesaje yo kote David avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:11">II Sam 5:11</ref></char></note>bwa sèd yo, mason ak chapant pou bati yon kay pou li. <verse eid="1CH 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 14:2" />Epi David te vin rekonèt ke SENYÈ a te etabli li kon wa sou Israël, epi ke wayòm li te a egzalte byen wo pou koz pèp li a, Israël.<verse eid="1CH 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 14:3" />David te pran plis madanm Jérusalem, e David te vin papa a plis fis ak fi. <verse eid="1CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 14:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 3:5-8">I Kwo 3:5-8</ref></char></note>Sila yo se non a pitit ki ne a li menm Jérusalem yo: Schammau, Schobab, Nathan, Salomon, <verse eid="1CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 14:5" />Jibhar, Élischua, Elphéleth, <verse eid="1CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 14:6" />Noga, Népheg, Japhia, <verse eid="1CH 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 14:7" />Élischama, Beéliada ak Éliphéleth.<verse eid="1CH 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 14:8" />Lè Filisten yo te tande ke David te onksyone wa sou tout Israël, tout Filisten yo te monte pou rankontre David. Lè David te tande sa li te sòti kont yo. <verse eid="1CH 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 14:9" />Alò, Filisten yo te vini e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 11:15">I Kwo 11:15</ref></char></note>fè yon atak nan vale Rephaïm nan. <verse eid="1CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 14:10" />David te mande Bondye, epi te di: “Èske mwen dwe monte kont Filisten yo? Èske Ou va livre yo nan men m?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 14:10">SENYÈ a te di li: “Monte, paske Mwen va livre yo nan men ou.”<verse eid="1CH 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 14:11" />Konsa, yo te rive monte Baal-Peratsim, e David te bat yo la. David te di: “Bondye te kraze lènmi mwen yo pa men mwen kon dlo k ap pete.” Pou sa, yo te rele plas sa a Baal-Peratsim. <verse eid="1CH 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 14:12" />Yo te abandone dye pa yo la. David te bay lòd pou yo te brile yo avèk dife.<verse eid="1CH 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 14:13" />Filisten yo te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 14:9">I Kwo 14:9</ref></char></note>yon lòt atak nan vale a. <verse eid="1CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 14:14" />David te mande a Bondye ankò e Bondye te di li: “Ou pa pou monte kont yo. Ansèkle yo pa dèyè e vini sou yo devan pye balzam yo. <verse eid="1CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 14:15" />Li va vin rive ke lè ou tande son mache a nan tèt pye balzam yo, alò, ou va sòti nan batay la; paske Bondye va gen tan sòti devan ou pou frape lame Filisten yo.”<verse eid="1CH 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 14:16" />David te fè menm sa ke Bondye te kòmande li. Yo te frape desann lame Filisten yo soti Gabaon jis rive menm nan Guézer. <verse eid="1CH 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 14:17" />Rekonesans a David te sòti rive nan tout peyi yo, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:14-16">Egz 15:14-16</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te mennen lakrent li sou tout nasyon yo.<verse eid="1CH 14:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CH 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 15:1" />Alò, David te bati kay pou li menm nan lavil David. Epi li te prepare yon plas pou lach Bondye a e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:3">I Kwo 15:3</ref></char></note>monte yon tant pou li. <verse eid="1CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 15:2" />Alò, David te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:15">Nonb 4:15</ref></char></note>“Pèsòn pa pou pote lach Bondye a sof ke Levit yo, paske SENYÈ a te chwazi yo pou pote lach Bondye a e pou fè sèvis a Li pou tout tan.”<verse eid="1CH 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 15:3" />Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:1">I Wa 8:1</ref></char></note>David te rasanble tout Israël Jérusalem pou pote fè monte lach Bondye a nan plas ke li te prepare pou li a. <verse eid="1CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 15:4" />David te rasanble tout fis a Aaron yo ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:16-30">I Kwo 6:16-30</ref></char></note>Levit yo: <verse eid="1CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 15:5" />Fis a Kehath yo, Uriel, chèf avèk frè li yo ak san-ven nan moun fanmi li yo; <verse eid="1CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 15:6" />fis a Merari yo, Asaja, chèf la ak de-san-ven nan fanmi pa li yo; <verse eid="1CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 15:7" />nan fis a Guerschom yo, Joël, chèf la ak san-trant nan fanmi pa li yo; <verse eid="1CH 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 15:8" />nan fis a Élitsaphan yo, Schemaeja, chèf la ak de-san nan fanmi pa li yo; <verse eid="1CH 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 15:9" />nan fis a Hébron yo, Éliel, chèf la ak katre-ven mesye nan fanmi pa li yo; <verse eid="1CH 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 15:10" />nan fis a Uziel yo, Amminadab, chèf la ak san-douz mesye nan fanmi pa li yo.<verse eid="1CH 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 15:11" />Alò, David te rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 12:28">I Kwo 12:28</ref></char></note>Tsadok ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 22:20-23">I Sam 22:20-23</ref></char></note>Abiathar, prèt yo ak Levit yo, Uriel, Asaja, Joël, Schemaeja, Éliel ak Amminadab. <verse eid="1CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 15:12" />Li te di yo: “Nou se chèf lakay zansèt nou yo pou Levit yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:14-15">Egz 19:14-15</ref></char></note>Konsakre nou menm, ni nou, ni manm fanmi pa nou, pou nou kapab pote fè monte lach SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, rive nan plas ke m te prepare pou li a. <verse eid="1CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 15:13" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:3">II Sam 6:3</ref></char></note>Akoz nou pa t pote l nan kòmansman an, SENYÈ a, Bondye pa nou an, te fè yon sèl pete sou nou, paske nou pa t chache Li selon règ li yo.”<verse eid="1CH 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 15:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 15:12">I Kwo 15:12</ref> </char>
    </note>Pou sa, prèt yo avèk Levit yo te konsakre yo menm pou pote fè monte lach SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la. <verse eid="1CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 15:15" />Fis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:14">Egz 25:14</ref></char></note>Levit yo te pote lach Bondye a sou zepòl pa yo avèk poto ki tache ladann, kon Moïse te kòmande yo pa pawòl SENYÈ a.<verse eid="1CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 15:16" />Epi David te pale avèk chèf Levit yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 13:8">I Kwo 13:8</ref></char></note>pou dispoze fanmi pa yo, chantè yo, avèk lenstriman mizik yo, ap yo, gita yo, senbal ki sonnen fò yo, pou fè leve kri lajwa yo. <verse eid="1CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 15:17" />Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 25:1">I Kwo 25:1</ref></char></note>Levit yo te chwazi Héman, fis a Joël la e soti nan fanmi pa li a, Asaph, fis a Bérékia a; epi soti nan fis a Merari yo avèk fanmi pa yo, Éthan, fis a Kuschaja a; <verse eid="1CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 15:18" />epi avèk yo, fanmi a dezyèm nivo a, Zacharie, Ben, Jaaziel, Schemiramoth, Jehiel, Unni, Éliab, Benaja, Maaséja, Matthithja, Éliphelé, avèk Miknéja, ak pòtè yo, Obed-Édom avèk Jeïel, gadyen pòt yo. <verse eid="1CH 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 15:19" />Konsa chantè yo, Héman, Asaph ak Éthan pou fè sonnen senbal bwonz yo; <verse eid="1CH 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 15:20" />epi Zacharie, Aziel, Schemiramoth, Jehiel, Unni, Éliab, Maaséja ak Benaja avèk ap ki te fè son selon Alamòt la; <verse eid="1CH 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 15:21" />epi Matthithia, Éliphelé, Miknéia, Obed-Édom, Jeïel avèk Azazia, pou pran avan avèk ap uit kòd pou kondwi chan an. <verse eid="1CH 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 15:22" />Kenania, chèf Levit yo, te an chaj chante a. Li te bay enstriksyon nan chante a paske li te fò. <verse eid="1CH 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 15:23" />Bérékia avèk Elkana te gadyen pòtay pou lach la. <verse eid="1CH 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 15:24" />Schebania, Josaphat, Nethaneel, Amasaï, Zacharie, Benaja ak Éliézer, prèt yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:28">I Kwo 15:28</ref></char></note>soufle twonpèt yo devan lach a Bondye a. Obed-Édom avèk Jechitja te gadyen pòtay lach la.<verse eid="1CH 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 15:25" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 6:12-15">II Sam 6:12-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa David, avèk lansyen Israël yo, avèk kapitèn a dè milye yo, te ale pou pote fè monte lach akò SENYÈ a soti lakay Obed-Édom nan mitan yon gran rejwisans. <verse eid="1CH 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 15:26" />Akoz Bondye t ap ede Levit ki t ap pote lach akò SENYÈ yo, yo te fè sakrifis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:1-29">Nonb 23:1-29</ref></char></note>sèt towo ak sèt belye. <verse eid="1CH 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 15:27" />Alò, David te abiye avèk yon manto len fen, menm avèk tout Levit ki t ap pote lach la, e chantè yo avèk Kenania, chèf mizik pami chantè yo. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:14">II Sam 6:14</ref></char></note>David te abiye osi ak yon efòd an len. <verse eid="1CH 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 15:28" />Konsa, tout Israël te pote monte lach akò SENYÈ a avèk gwo kri, avèk son a kòn soufle, avèk twonpèt, avèk gwo bwi a senbal, avèk ap ak gita. <verse eid="1CH 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 15:29" />Li te rive lè lach akò SENYÈ a te vini nan vil David la, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:13">II Sam 3:13</ref></char></note>Mical, fi a Saül la, te gade deyò fenèt la e te wè Wa David t ap vòltije e selebre. Konsa, li te meprize li nan kè l.<verse eid="1CH 15:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CH 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 16:1" />Yo te pote lach Bondye a e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:1">I Kwo 15:1</ref></char></note>plase li nan tant ke David te fè monte pou li a. Epi yo te ofri ofrann brile avèk ofrann lapè devan Bondye. <verse eid="1CH 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 16:2" />Lè David te fin fè ofrann brile ak ofrann lapè a, li te beni pèp la nan non a SENYÈ a. <verse eid="1CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 16:3" />Li te separe bay a chak moun Israël, ni gason, ni fanm, yo chak yon pen avèk yon pòsyon vyann ak yon gato rezen.<verse eid="1CH 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 16:4" />Li te chwazi kèk nan Levit yo pou pran chaj sèvis la devan lach SENYÈ a, pou selebre menm e bay remèsiman avèk lwanj a SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la: <verse eid="1CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 16:5" />Asaph, chèf la e dezyèm apre li a, Zacharie, swiv pa Jeïel, Schemiramoth, Jehiel, Matthithia, Éliab, Benaja, Obed-Édom ak Jeïel avèk lenstriman mizik yo, ap yo, gita yo; epi Asaph sou senbal gwo bwi yo, <verse eid="1CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 16:6" />epi Benaja avèk Jachaziel, prèt ki t ap soufle twonpèt san rete yo devan lach akò Bondye a.<verse eid="1CH 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 16:7" />Alò, se te nan jou sa a, David te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 22:1">II Sam 22:1</ref></char></note> chwazi pou premye fwa a, Asaph avèk fanmi li pou bay remèsiman a SENYÈ a.<verse eid="1CH 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 16:8" />O bay remèsiman a SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:8">Rele non Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:8">Fè zèv li yo rekonèt pami pèp yo.<verse eid="1CH 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 16:9" />Chante a Li menm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:9">Chante lwanj a Li menm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:9">Pale tout mèvèy Li yo.<verse eid="1CH 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 16:10" />Bay glwa a sen non Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:10">Kite kè a sila k ap chache SENYÈ a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:10">vin ranpli ak jwa.<verse eid="1CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 16:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 24:6">Sòm 24:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Chache SENYÈ a avèk fòs Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:11">Chache figi Li san rete.<verse eid="1CH 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 16:12" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 103:2">Sòm 103:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sonje zèv mèvèy ke Li te fè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:12">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 78:43-68">Sòm 78:43-68</ref>
      </char>
    </note>mèvèy Li yo ak jijman,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:12">ki sòti depi nan bouch Li,<verse eid="1CH 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 16:13" />O desandan Israël, sèvitè Li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:13">fis a Jacob yo, sila Li te chwazi yo!<verse eid="1CH 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 16:14" />Li se SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:14">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 48:10">Sòm 48:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jijman pa Li yo sou tout latè.<verse eid="1CH 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 16:15" />Sonje akò Li a pou tout tan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:15">Pawòl ke Li te kòmande a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:15">mil jenerasyon yo,<verse eid="1CH 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 16:16" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:7">Jen 12:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>akò ke li te fè avèk</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:16">Abraham nan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:16">sèman an ke Li te fè avèk Isaac la.<verse eid="1CH 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 16:17" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 35:11-12">Jen 35:11-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Li te konfime sa ak Jacob kon yon règleman,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:17">A Israël, kon yon akò ki pou tout tan,<verse eid="1CH 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 16:18" />epi te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:15">Jen 13:15</ref></char></note>“A ou menm, Mwen va bay</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:18">peyi Canaan an kon pòsyon eritaj pa w.”<verse eid="1CH 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 16:19" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 34:30">Jen 34:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Pandan yo te piti an nonb, trè piti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:19">e etranje, yo nan li,<verse eid="1CH 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 16:20" />yo te mache toupatou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:20">nan yon nasyon a yon lòt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:20">sòti nan yon wayòm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:20">pou rive nan yon lòt pèp.<verse eid="1CH 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 16:21" />Li pa t kite okenn moun oprime yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:21">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:17">Jen 12:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li te bay repwòch a wa yo pou koz pa yo.<verse eid="1CH 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 16:22" />Li te di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:7">Jen 20:7</ref></char></note>“Pa touche onksyone pa M yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:22">ni pa fè mal a pwofèt Mwen yo.”<verse eid="1CH 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 16:23" />Chante a SENYÈ a, tout latè!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:23">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 96:1-13">Sòm 96:1-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pwoklame bòn nouvèl delivrans Li jou apre jou.<verse eid="1CH 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 16:24" />Pale glwa Li pami nasyon yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:24">gran mèvèy Li yo pami tout pèp yo.<verse eid="1CH 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 16:25" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 144:3-6">Sòm 144:3-6</ref></char></note>gran se SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:25">e gran pou resevwa lwanj yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:25">Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:7">Sòm 89:7</ref> </char></note>fòk nou gen lakrent Li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:25">plis pase tout lòt dye yo.<verse eid="1CH 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 16:26" />Paske tout dye a pèp yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:26">se zidòl yo ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:26">men SENYÈ a te fè syèl yo.<verse eid="1CH 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 16:27" />Tout richès avèk majeste devan Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:27">Lafòs ak lajwa lakay Li.<verse eid="1CH 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 16:28" />Bay a SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:28">O tout fanmi yo ak tout pèp yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:28">bay a SENYÈ a glwa avèk fòs!<verse eid="1CH 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 16:29" />Bay a SENYÈ a glwa ke non Li dwe genyen an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:29">Pote lofrann yo vini devan L.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:29">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 29:2">Sòm 29:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Adore SENYÈ a avèk tout bagay sen yo.<verse eid="1CH 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 16:30" />Tranble devan Li, tout latè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:30">Anverite, lemond etabli byen solid.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:30">Li p ap deplase menm.<verse eid="1CH 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 16:31" />Kite syèl yo kontan e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:31">kite lemond rejwi:<verse eid="1CH 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 16:32" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 98:7">Sòm 98:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kite lanmè a fè gwo bwi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:32">avèk tout sa ki ladann!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:32">Kite chan an ranpli ak jwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:32">ak tout sa ki ladann!<verse eid="1CH 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 16:33" />Konsa, tout bwa forè yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:33">va chante avèk jwa devan SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:33">Paske L ap vini pou jije latè.<verse eid="1CH 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 16:34" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 106:1">Sòm 106:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O bay remèsiman a SENYÈ a pou bonte Li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:34">paske lanmou dous Li a se pou tout tan.<verse eid="1CH 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 16:35" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 106:47-48">Sòm 106:47-48</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Di: “Sove nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:35">O Bondye a delivrans nou an!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:35">Ranmase nou pou sove nou soti nan nasyon yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:35">pou bay remèsiman a non sen pa W la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:35">pou nou trionfe nan lwanj Ou.”<verse eid="1CH 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 16:36" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:15-56">I Wa 8:15-56</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Beni se SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:36">Pou letènite, jis rive nan letènite a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:36">Tout pèp la te di: “Amen” e te louwe SENYÈ a.<verse eid="1CH 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 16:37" />Konsa, li te kite<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 8:14">II Kwo 8:14</ref></char></note>Asaph avèk fanmi li la devan lach akò SENYÈ a pou fè sèvis devan lach la tout tan, kon travay chak jou te egzije a; <verse eid="1CH 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 16:38" />epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 13:14">I Kwo 13:14</ref></char></note>Obed-Édom avèk swasant-uit manm fanmi li; Obed-Édom e anplis fis a Jedithun lan, avèk Hosa kon gadyen pòtay yo, <verse eid="1CH 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 16:39" />Li te kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:11">I Kwo 15:11</ref></char></note>Tsadok, prèt la avèk fanmi pa li yo devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:4">I Wa 3:4</ref> </char></note>tabènak SENYÈ a nan wo plas ki te Gabaon an, <verse eid="1CH 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 16:40" />pou ofri ofrann brile yo a SENYÈ a sou lotèl ofrann brile a tout tan, ni maten, ni aswè, jis selon tout sa ki ekri nan lalwa SENYÈ a, ke Li te kòmande Israël yo. <verse eid="1CH 16:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 16:41" />Avèk yo, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:33">I Kwo 6:33</ref></char></note>Héman, Jeduthun ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 25:1-6">I Kwo 25:1-6</ref></char></note>lòt ki te dezinye pa non yo, pou bay remèsiman a SENYÈ a, akoz lanmou dous li an san fen. <verse eid="1CH 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 16:42" />Epi avèk yo, te Héman ak Jeduthun avèk twonpèt avèk senbal pou sila ki te gen pou fè enstriman retantisan pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 25:7">I Kwo 25:7</ref></char></note>chan Bondye yo e fis a Jeduthun yo, pou pòtay la. <verse eid="1CH 16:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 16:43" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:19">II Sam 6:19</ref></char></note>Epi tout pèp la te pati, yo chak lakay yo e David te retounen pou beni lakay pa li a.<verse eid="1CH 16:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1CH 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 17:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 7:1-29">II Sam 7:1-29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li te vin rive ke lè David te rete lakay li, ke David te di a Nathan, pwofèt la: “Gade byen, mwen rete nan yon kay fèt ak sèd, men lach akò SENYÈ a rete anba rido.”<verse eid="1CH 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 17:2" />Nathan te di a David: “Fè tout sa ki nan kè ou, paske Bondye avèk ou.”<verse eid="1CH 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 17:3" />Li te vin rive nan menm nwit lan ke pawòl SENYÈ a te parèt a Nathan. Li te di: <verse eid="1CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 17:4" />“Ale pale David, sèvitè Mwen an, ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:2-3">I Kwo 28:2-3</ref></char></note>“Ou pa pou bati yon kay pou Mwen pou M rete ladann; <verse eid="1CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 17:5" />paske Mwen pa t konn rete nan yon kay depi jou ke M te mennen Israël monte a, jis rive jodi a; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:2-3">Egz 40:2-3</ref></char></note>men Mwen te ale soti de tant a tant e soti yon kote pou rete jis rive a yon lòt. <verse eid="1CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 17:6" />Nan tout plas kote Mwen te mache avèk Israël yo, èske Mwen te pale yon mo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:7">II Sam 7:7</ref></char></note>avèk okenn nan jij Israël yo pou Mwen te kòmande yo pou fè bèje a pèp Mwen an, epi te di yo: ‘Poukisa ou pa t bati pou Mwen yon kay an sèd?’”<verse eid="1CH 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 17:7" />Alò, pou sa, konsa ou va pale ak sèvitè Mwen an, David: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a dèzame yo: “Mwen te retire ou nan pak kote ou t ap swiv mouton, pou devni chèf sou pèp Mwen an, Israël. <verse eid="1CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 17:8" />Mwen te avèk ou tout kote ke ou te ale, e te koupe devan ou tout lènmi ou yo. Konsa, Mwen va fè yon non pou ou pare ak pi gwo moun sou latè yo. <verse eid="1CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 17:9" />Mwen va chwazi yon plas pou pèp Israël Mwen an e va plante yo, pou yo kab rete nan pwòp plas yo, pou yo pa vin deplase ankò. Konsa, mechan yo p ap epwize yo ankò tankou oparavan, <verse eid="1CH 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 17:10" />depi jou ke M te kòmande jij yo vini sou pèp Israël Mwen an. Konsa, Mwen va soumèt tou lènmi ou yo. Anplis, Mwen di ou, ke SENYÈ a va bati yon kay pou ou. <verse eid="1CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 17:11" />Lè jou yo acheve pou ou oblije ale jwenn zansèt ou yo, Mwen va plase youn nan desandan apre ou yo, ki va nan fis ou yo; epi Mwen va etabli wayòm pa li. <verse eid="1CH 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 17:12" />Li va bati pou Mwen yon kay e mwen va etabli twòn li jis pou tout tan. <verse eid="1CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 17:13" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 1:5">Eb 1:5</ref></char></note>Mwen va papa li e li va fis Mwen. Mwen p ap retire lanmou dous Mwen sou li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 10:14">I Kwo 10:14</ref></char></note>tankou Mwen te retire li sou sila ki te avan ou an. <verse eid="1CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 17:14" />Men Mwen va etabli li lakay Mwen ak nan wayòm Mwen an jis pou tout tan e twòn li an va etabli nèt pou tout tan.”’” <verse eid="1CH 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 17:15" />Selon tout pawòl sa yo e selon vizyon sila a, konsa Nathan te pale ak David.<verse eid="1CH 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 17:16" />Konsa, wa David te antre e te chita devan SENYÈ a epi te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:18">II Sam 7:18</ref></char></note>“Se kilès mwen ye, O SENYÈ a, Bondye a e kisa lakay mwen ye pou Ou te mennen m rive jis isit la? <verse eid="1CH 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 17:17" />Sa se te yon ti bagay nan zye Ou, O Bondye, men Ou te pale afè lakay sèvitè Ou a pou anpil tan k ap vini, e te gade mwen kon yon moun gran valè, O SENYÈ Bondye. <verse eid="1CH 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 17:18" />Kisa, anplis, David kapab di Ou selon onè ki bay a sèvitè Ou a? Paske ou konnen sèvitè Ou. <verse eid="1CH 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 17:19" />O SENYÈ, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:21">II Sam 7:21</ref></char></note>pou koz sèvitè ou a, e selon pwòp kè pa Ou, Ou te prepare tout grandè sa a, pou ta fè konnen tout gran afè sila yo. <verse eid="1CH 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 17:20" />O SENYÈ, nanpwen lòt tankou Ou, ni nanpwen okenn Bondye sof ke Ou, selon tout sa ke nou te tande avèk zòrèy nou. <verse eid="1CH 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 17:21" />Epi ki lòt nasyon sou latè ki tankou pèp Ou a, Israël, ke Bondye te ale peye ranson a Li menm yon pèp; pou fè yon non pou Ou pa bagay ki te gran e mèvèye yo, lè Ou te pouse, fè soti tout lòt nasyon yo devan pèp Ou a, ke Ou te rachete, fè soti nan Egypte. <verse eid="1CH 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 17:22" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5-6">Egz 19:5-6</ref></char></note>Paske pèp Ou a, Israël, Ou te fè pwòp pèp Ou a jis pou tout tan e Ou menm, O SENYÈ, te vin Bondye pa yo. <verse eid="1CH 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 17:23" />Koulye a, O SENYÈ, kite pawòl ke Ou te pale pa sèvitè Ou a, selon lakay li vin etabli jis pou tout tan an. Fè jan Ou te pale a. <verse eid="1CH 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 17:24" />Kite non pa Ou vin etabli e onore jis pou tout tan, epi di: SENYÈ dèzame yo se Bondye a Israël la, yon Bondye menm pou Israël. Konsa, lakay David, sèvitè Ou a se etabli devan Ou. <verse eid="1CH 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 17:25" />Paske Ou menm, O Bondye mwen, te revele a sèvitè Ou a, ke Ou va bati pou li yon kay. Pou sa, sèvitè Ou a te twouve kouraj pou vin priye devan Ou. <verse eid="1CH 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 17:26" />Koulye a, O SENYÈ, Ou se Bondye e te pwomèt bon bagay sa a sèvitè Ou a. <verse eid="1CH 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 17:27" />Konsa, sa te fè Ou plezi pou beni lakay sèvitè Ou a, pou li kapab kontinye jis pou tout tan devan Ou. Paske Ou menm, O SENYÈ, te fè l beni e li menm vin beni jis pou tout tan.”<verse eid="1CH 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1CH 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 18:1" />Apre sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:1-18">II Sam 8:1-18</ref></char></note>li te vin rive ke David te bat Filisten yo. Li te fè yo soumèt e te pran Gath avèk vil pa li yo nan men a Filisten yo. <verse eid="1CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 18:2" />Li te bat Moab e Moabit yo te vin sèvitè a David e te pote kontribisyon obligatwa yo.<verse eid="1CH 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 18:3" />David osi te bat Hadarézer, wa Tsoba a, jis rive Hamath, e li te sòti pou ale etabli wayòm li jis rive nan Rivyè Euphrate la. <verse eid="1CH 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 18:4" />David te pran nan men Hadarézer, mil cha avèk sèt-mil chevalye ak ven-mil sòlda a pye. David te koupe jarèt a tout cheval a cha yo, men te konsève kont pou rale san cha. <verse eid="1CH 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 18:5" />Lè Siryen nan Damas yo te vini ede <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 19:6">I Kwo 19:6</ref></char></note>Hadarézer, wa Tsoba a, David te touye venn-de-mil òm nan Siryen yo. <verse eid="1CH 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 18:6" />Konsa, David te fè mete ganizon sòlda pami Siryen nan Damas yo. Siryen yo te vin sèvitè a David e te pote kontribisyon obligatwa. Nenpòt kote li te ale, SENYÈ a te ede David. <verse eid="1CH 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 18:7" />David te pran boukliye an lò yo ki te pote pa sèvitè Hadarézer yo pou te pote yo Jérusalem. <verse eid="1CH 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 18:8" />Osi, soti Thibchath avèk Cun, vil a Hadarézer yo, David te pran yon trè gran kantite bwonz avèk sila <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:40-47">I Wa 7:40-47</ref></char></note>Salomon te fè lanmè a an bwonz e pilye avèk zouti yo te fèt an bwonz.<verse eid="1CH 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 18:9" />Alò, lè Thohu, wa Hamath la, te tande ke David te fin bat tout lame a Hadarézer a, wa Tsoba a, <verse eid="1CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 18:10" />li te voye Hadoram, fis li a, kote wa David pou salye li e beni li; paske li te goumen kont Hadarézer e te bat li; paske Hadarézer t ap fè lagè avèk Thohu. Epi Hadoram te pote tout kalite bagay an lò avèk ajan ak bwonz. <verse eid="1CH 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 18:11" />Wa David te konsakre sa yo osi a SENYÈ a, avèk ajan ak lò ke li te rache pote soti nan men a tout nasyon yo: depi nan Edom, Moab, fis a Ammon yo, Filisten yo ak Amalekit yo.<verse eid="1CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 18:12" />Anplis, Abischaï, fis a Tseruja a, te bat diz-ui-mil Edomit nan Vale Sèl la. <verse eid="1CH 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 18:13" />Epi li te mete ganizon sòlda nan Edom, e tout Edomit yo te devni sèvitè David. Epi SENYÈ a te ede David nenpòt kote li te ale.<verse eid="1CH 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 18:14" />Konsa, David te renye sou tout Israël. Li te administre jistis avèk ladwati pou tout pèp li a. <verse eid="1CH 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 18:15" />Joab, fis a Tseruja a, te kòmandan lame a, e Josaphat, fis a Achilud la, te achivist la; <verse eid="1CH 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 18:16" />epi Tsadok, fis a Achithub la avèk Abimélèc, fis a Abiathar a, te prèt, e Schavscha te sekretè; <verse eid="1CH 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 18:17" />epi Benaja, fis a Jehojada a, te chèf sou Keretyen avèk Peletyen yo; epi fis a David yo te premye chèf ansanm akote wa a.<verse eid="1CH 18:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1CH 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 19:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 10:1-19">II Sam 10:1-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, li te vin rive apre sa, ke Nachasch, wa a fis a Ammon yo te mouri e fis li a te devni wa nan plas li. <verse eid="1CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 19:2" />Epi David te di: “Mwen va montre favè a Hanun, fis a Nachasch la, akoz papa li te montre m favè.” Pou sa, David te voye mesaje pou konsole li selon lanmò papa li. Sèvitè David yo te antre nan peye fis a Ammon yo pou konsole Hanun. <verse eid="1CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 19:3" />Men chèf a fis a Ammon yo te di a Hanun: “Èske ou kwè ke David ap bay papa ou onè akoz li voye moun rekonfòte yo? Èske sèvitè li yo pa vin kote ou pou chèche fè espyonaj pou boulvèse peyi a?” <verse eid="1CH 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 19:4" />Epi Hanun te pran sèvitè David yo e te taye tout cheve yo, koupe vètman yo nan mitan jis rive nan kwis e te voye yo ale. <verse eid="1CH 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 19:5" />Alò, kèk moun te ale pale David konsènan afè mesye yo. Epi li te voye rankontre yo, paske mesye sa yo te byen wont. Epi wa a te di: “Rete Jéricho jiskaske bab nou vin grandi ankò e retounen.”<verse eid="1CH 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 19:6" />Lè fis a Ammon yo te wè ke yo te fè tèt yo rayisab a David, Hanun avèk fis a Ammon yo te voye mil talan ajan Mésopotamie pou achte sèvis a cha avèk chevalye Siryen ki te sòti nan Maaca avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 18:5-9">I Kwo 18:5-9</ref></char></note>Tsoba. <verse eid="1CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 19:7" />Konsa, yo te achte sèvis a trann-de-mil cha e wa Maaca a avèk pèp li a, ki te vin fè kan devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:30">Nonb 21:30</ref></char></note>Médeba a. Fis a Ammon yo te rasanble soti nan vil pa yo pou te vin batay. <verse eid="1CH 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 19:8" />Lè David tande sa, li te voye Joab avèk tout lame, mesye pwisan yo. <verse eid="1CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 19:9" />Fis a Ammon yo te vin parèt, te rale yo nan chan batay la nan antre vil la e wa ki te vini yo te la apa pou kont yo nan chan an.<verse eid="1CH 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 19:10" />Alò, lè Joab te wè ke batay la te prepare kont li ni devan, ni dèyè; li te chwazi soti nan mesye pi chwazi pami tout Israël yo e yo te alinye yo kont Siryen yo. <verse eid="1CH 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 19:11" />Men retay a pèp la, li te plase nan men Abischaï, frè li a; epi yo te alinye yo kont fis Ammon yo. <verse eid="1CH 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 19:12" />Li te di: “Si Siryen yo twò fò pou mwen, alò ou va ede m; men si fis a Ammon twò fò pou ou; alò, mwen va ede ou. <verse eid="1CH 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 19:13" />Kenbe fèm e annou montre kouraj nou pou koz pèp nou ak pou vil Bondye pa nou yo. Epi ke SENYÈ a va fè sa ki bon nan zye li.”<verse eid="1CH 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 19:14" />Konsa, Joab avèk moun ki te avèk li yo te ale toupre batay la kont Siryen yo e yo te sove ale devan li. <verse eid="1CH 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 19:15" />Lè fis a Ammon yo te wè ke Siryen yo te sove ale, yo te sove ale osi devan Abischaï, frè li a e te antre lavil la. Epi Joab te vini Jérusalem.<verse eid="1CH 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 19:16" />Lè Siryen yo te wè ke yo te bat pa Israël, yo te voye mesaje pou te mennen fè sòti Siryen ki te lòtbò Rivyè a, avèk Schophach, chèf lame Hadarézer ki t ap dirije yo a. <verse eid="1CH 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 19:17" />Lè bagay sa a te pale a David, li te ranmase tout Israël ansanm, te travèse Jourdain an, te vin parèt sou yo e te rale nan fòmasyon batay kont yo a. Epi lè David te rale nan fòmasyon batay la kont Siryen yo, yo te goumen kont li. <verse eid="1CH 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 19:18" />Siryen yo te sove ale devan Israël e David te touye nan Siryen yo, sèt-mil mèt cha avèk karant-mil sòlda a pye e te mete a lanmò Schophach, chèf lame a. <verse eid="1CH 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 19:19" />Konsa, lè sèvitè a Hadarézer yo te wè ke yo te fin bat pa Israël, yo te fè lapè avèk David e te sèvi li. Konsa, Siryen yo pa t janm dakò ankò pou ede fis a Ammon yo.<verse eid="1CH 19:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1CH 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 20:1" />Li te vin rive nan prentan, nan lè ke wa yo konn sòti fè lagè, ke Joab te mennen sòti lame a, e te ravaje peyi a fis a Ammon yo. Li te vin fè syèj kont Rabba. Men David te rete Jérusalem. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:26">II Sam 12:26</ref></char></note>Joab te frape Rabba e te boulvèse li nèt. <verse eid="1CH 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 20:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:30-31">II Sam 12:30-31</ref></char></note>David te retire kouwòn a wa pa yo soti sou tèt li. Li te twouve ke li te peze yon talan lò, e te gen pyè presye yo ladann. Konsa, yo te plase li sou tèt a David. Konsa, li te mennen fè sòti piyaj nan vil la, yon trè gran kantite. <verse eid="1CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 20:3" />Li te mennen fè sòti moun ki te ladann yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:31">II Sam 12:31</ref></char></note> te koupe yo avèk si ak enstriman file e avèk rach. Konsa David te fè a tout vil ki te pou fis a Ammon yo. Alò David avèk tout moun yo te retounen Jérusalem.<verse eid="1CH 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 20:4" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 21:18-22">II Sam 21:18-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò li te vin rive apre sa ke lagè te vin pete nan Guézer avèk Filisten yo. Konsa, Sibbecaï, Oushatit la, te touye Sippaï, youn nan desandan a jeyan yo, e yo te vin soumèt yo.<verse eid="1CH 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 20:5" />Te gen lagè avèk Filisten yo ankò e Elchanan, fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:19">II Sam 21:19</ref></char></note>Jaïr a, te touye frè a Goliath la, Gatit la. Shaf a lans li an te gwo tankou shaf aparèy tise a. <verse eid="1CH 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 20:6" />Ankò, te gen lagè avèk Gath kote te gen yon nonm gran wotè ki te genyen venn-kat dwèt ak zòtèy, sis avèk sis e li menm, osi, te yon desandan a jeyan yo. <verse eid="1CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 20:7" />Lè li te voye defi bay Israël, Jonathan, fis a Schimea a, frè David la, te touye li. <verse eid="1CH 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 20:8" />Mesye sila yo te jeyan Gath yo e yo te tonbe pa lamen David, ak lamen sèvitè li yo.<verse eid="1CH 20:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1CH 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 21:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 24:1-25">II Sam 24:1-25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, Satan te kanpe kont Israël e te bourade David pou kontwole moun Israël yo. <verse eid="1CH 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 21:2" />Pou sa, David te di a Joab, e a chèf a pèp yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 27:23-24">I Kwo 27:23-24</ref></char></note>“Ale konte moun Israël yo soti Beer-Schéba jis rive Dan, e pote ban m chif yo pou m kab konnen fòs kantite yo.”<verse eid="1CH 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 21:3" />Joab te di: “Ke SENYÈ a kapab ogmante sou pèp li a san fwa ke sa! Men mèt mwen, wa a, èske yo tout se pa sèvitè mèt mwen an? Poukisa mèt mwen an ap chache afè sa a? Poukisa sa ta dwe koz pou Israël ta vin koupab?”<verse eid="1CH 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 21:4" />Malgre sa, pawòl wa a te vin genyen kont pawòl Joab yo. Konsa, Joab te sòti ale nan tout Israël pou te rive Jérusalem. <verse eid="1CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 21:5" />Joab te bay nimewo a tout moun a David yo. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:9">II Sam 24:9</ref></char></note>tout Israël, mesye ki te rale nepe yo, se te yon milyon-san-mil òm e Juda te kat-san-swasann-dis òm ki te rale nepe yo. <verse eid="1CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 21:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 27:24">I Kwo 27:24</ref></char></note>Men li pa t kontwole Lévi avèk Benjamin pami yo, paske kòmand wa a te twouve byen rayisab pou Joab.<verse eid="1CH 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 21:7" />“Bondye pa t kontan avèk bagay sa a e pou sa, li te frape Israël. <verse eid="1CH 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 21:8" />David te di a Bondye: Mwen te peche anpil, pwiske mwen te fè bagay sa a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:13">II Sam 12:13</ref></char></note>Men souple, koulye a, retire inikite a sèvitè Ou a, paske mwen te fè yon bagay byen sòt.”<verse eid="1CH 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 21:9" />SENYÈ a te pale ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:11">II Sam 24:11</ref></char></note>Gad, konseye David la, epi te di l: <verse eid="1CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 21:10" />“Ale pale ak David. Di l: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a, “M ap ofri ou twa bagay. Chwazi pou kont ou youn nan yo, ke mwen va fè pou ou.”’”<verse eid="1CH 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 21:11" />Konsa, Gad te vin kote David. Li te di l: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a, ‘Pran pou ou menm <verse eid="1CH 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 21:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:13">II Sam 24:13</ref></char></note>oswa, twazan gwo grangou, oswa twa mwa ke ou va chase kraze nèt pa lènmi ou, pandan nepe pa yo ap pran ou nèt, oswa gwo epidemi nan peyi a avèk zanj SENYÈ a k ap detwi toupatou nan tout teritwa Israël la.’ Pou sa, reflechi sou repons ke mwen va retounen bay a Sila ki te voye mwen an.”<verse eid="1CH 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 21:13" />David te di a Gad: “Mwen byen twouble. Souple, kite mwen tonbe nan men SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:1">Sòm 51:1</ref></char></note>paske mizerikòd Li byen gran. Men pa kite mwen tonbe nan men a lòm.”<verse eid="1CH 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 21:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 27:24">I Kwo 27:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, SENYÈ a te voye epidemi sou Israël. Swasann-di-mil nan mesye Israël yo te tonbe. <verse eid="1CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 21:15" />Epi Bondye te voye yon zanj Jérusalem pou detwi vil la, men lè l te prè pou detwi, SENYÈ a te wè, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:14">Egz 32:14</ref></char></note>lache de gwo dega a. Li te di a zanj ki t ap detwi a: “Sa kont. Alò, lache men ou.” Zanj SENYÈ a t ap kanpe akote glasi vannen ki pou Ornan an, Jebizyen an. <verse eid="1CH 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 21:16" />David te leve zye li, e te wè zanj SENYÈ a ki te kanpe antre syèl la avèk tè a, avèk nepe li rale nan men l, lonje sou Jérusalem.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 21:16">Konsa, David avèk ansyen yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:27">I Wa 21:27</ref></char></note>kouvri yo avèk twal sak e te tonbe sou figi yo. <verse eid="1CH 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 21:17" />David te di a Bondye: “Èske se pa mwen menm ki te kòmande kontwòl a tout pèp la? Anverite, se te mwen ki te peche e ki te fè anpil mal. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:8">II Sam 7:8</ref></char></note>Men mouton sila yo, se kisa yo menm te fè? O SENYÈ, Bondye mwen an, souple, kite men Ou vin kont mwen avèk lakay zansèt mwen yo, men pa kont pèp Ou a, pou yo ta vin toumante.”<verse eid="1CH 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 21:18" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 3:1">II Kwo 3:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, zanj SENYÈ a te kòmande Gad pou pale David, pou David ta dwe monte pou bati yon lotèl a SENYÈ a sou glasi vannen ki te pou Ornan an, Jebizyen an. <verse eid="1CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 21:19" />Konsa, David te monte selon pawòl ke Gad te pale nan non SENYÈ a.<verse eid="1CH 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 21:20" />Alò, Ornan te vire fè bak, e li te wè zanj lan. Kat fis pa li yo ki te avè l yo te kache tèt yo. Alò, Ornan t ap bat ble. <verse eid="1CH 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 21:21" />Lè David te vin kote Ornan, Ornan te gade. Li te wè David e te sòti nan glasi vannen an pou te pwostène li menm devan David avèk figi li atè.<verse eid="1CH 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 21:22" />Alò, David te di a Ornan: “Ban mwen anplasman sila a avèk glasi vannen an, pou m kab bati yon lotèl a SENYÈ a. Pou valè tout pri li, ou va ban mwen li, pou touman sila a kab vin frennen pami pèp la.”<verse eid="1CH 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 21:23" />Ornan te di a David: “Pran li pou kont ou, epi kite mèt mwen an, wa a, fè sa ki bon nan zye l. Gade, mwen bay ou bèf yo pou ofrann brile a ak mas pilon, kon bwa ak ble kon ofrann sereyal la. M ap ba ou tout.”<verse eid="1CH 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 21:24" />Men Wa David te di a Ornan: “Non, men anverite, mwen va achte li pou tout pri li. Paske mwen p ap pran sa ki pou ou pou SENYÈ a, ni ofri ofrann brile ki pa t koute mwen anyen.”<verse eid="1CH 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 21:25" />Konsa David te bay Ornan sis-san sik an lò selon pwa li pou anplasman an. <verse eid="1CH 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 21:26" />Alò, David te bati yon lotèl a SENYÈ a la, e te ofri ofrann brile yo avèk ofrann lapè yo. Li te rele SENYÈ a, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:24">Lev 9:24</ref></char></note>Li te reponn li avèk dife soti nan syèl la sou lotèl ofrann brile a.<verse eid="1CH 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 21:27" />SENYÈ a te kòmande zanj lan e li te remèt nepe li nan fouwo.<verse eid="1CH 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 21:28" />Nan lè sa, lè David te wè ke SENYÈ a te reponn li sou glasi vannen Ornan an, Jebizyen an. Li te ofri yon sakrifis la. <verse eid="1CH 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 21:29" />Paske tabènak SENYÈ a, ke Moïse te fè nan dezè a ak lotèl ofrann brile a te nan wo plas Gabaon an nan lè sa a. <verse eid="1CH 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 21:30" />Men David pa t kab ale devan li nan Gabaon pou fè demand Bondye, paske nepe zanj SENYÈ a te bay li gwo lakrent.<verse eid="1CH 21:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1CH 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 22:1" />Konsa David te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 21:18-28">I Kwo 21:18-28</ref></char></note>“Sa se lakay SENYÈ a, Bondye a, e sa se lotèl ofrann brile pou Israël la.”<verse eid="1CH 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 22:2" />Pou sa, David te bay lòd pou ranmase tout etranje ki te nan peyi Israël yo. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:17-18">I Wa 5:17-18</ref></char></note>li te mete taye wòch nan travay pou koupe wòch pou bati kay Bondye a. <verse eid="1CH 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 22:3" />David te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:2-7">I Kwo 29:2-7</ref></char></note>prepare yon gran kantite fè pou fè klou pou pòt pòtay yo ak pou kranpon yo e plis bwonz ki ta kab peze yo. <verse eid="1CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 22:4" />Epi twòn bwa sèd yo te depase kontwòl, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:6-10">I Wa 5:6-10</ref></char></note>Sidonyen yo avèk Tyriens yo te mennen gran kantite a twòn bwa sèd yo kote David. <verse eid="1CH 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 22:5" />David te di: “Fis mwen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:7">I Wa 3:7</ref></char></note>Salomon jèn, epi manke eksperyans. Epi kay k ap bati pou SENYÈ a va tèlman ekstrawòdinè, byen koni toupatou, e k ap renome pou glwa li nan tout peyi yo. Se pou sa ke mwen va fè preparasyon pou li.” Konsa, David te fè anpil preparasyon avan l te mouri. <verse eid="1CH 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 22:6" />Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:1">I Wa 2:1</ref></char></note>li te rele fis li a, Salomon e te òdone li pou bati yon kay pou non SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la. <verse eid="1CH 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 22:7" />David te di a Salomon: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:2-3">II Sam 7:2-3</ref></char></note>“Fis mwen, mwen te gen entansyon pou bati yon kay a non SENYÈ a, Bondye mwen an. <verse eid="1CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 22:8" />Men pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:3">I Kwo 28:3</ref></char></note>Ou gen tan vèse anpil san, e te fè gwo lagè sou latè. Ou pa p bati yon kay pou non mwen, akoz ou te vèse anpil san sou latè devan zye m. <verse eid="1CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 22:9" />Men gade byen, youn fis ki va ne a ou menm yo, va yon moun lapè. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:20-25">I Wa 4:20-25</ref></char></note>Mwen va bay li repo soti nan tout lènmi li yo nan tout kote. Paske non li va Salomon e mwen va bay lapè avèk kalm an Israël nan jou pa li yo. <verse eid="1CH 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 22:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:13-14">II Sam 7:13-14</ref></char></note>Li va bati yon kay pou non Mwen. Li va fis Mwen e Mwen va papa li. Konsa, mwen va etabli twòn wayòm li sou Israël jis pou tout tan. <verse eid="1CH 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 22:11" />Koulye a, fis mwen an, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:16">I Kwo 22:16</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a kapab avèk ou, pou ou kapab byen reyisi, e bati lakay SENYÈ a, Bondye pa w la, jis jan ke li te pale selon ou menm nan. <verse eid="1CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 22:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:9-12">I Wa 3:9-12</ref></char></note>Sèlman ke SENYÈ a ta kapab bay ou sajès avèk konprann pou fè ou renye sou Israël, pou ou kapab kenbe lalwa a SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a. <verse eid="1CH 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 22:13" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:7">I Kwo 28:7</ref></char></note>Konsa, ou va byen reyisi, si ou fè atansyon pou swiv règleman avèk lòd ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse selon Israël yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:9">Jos 6:9</ref></char></note>Kenbe fèm e pran kouraj. Pa dekouraje, ni pa krent anyen. <verse eid="1CH 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 22:14" />Alò, gade byen, avèk gwo lapèn mwen te prepare pou lakay SENYÈ a, san-mil talan lò, yon-milyon talan ajan e bwonz avèk fè ki depase peze, akoz yo tèlman anpil. Anplis, gran twòn bwa avèk wòch ke m te prepare, e ou gen dwa mete sou yo toujou. <verse eid="1CH 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 22:15" />Anplis, gen anpil ouvriye ki avèk ou, tayè wòch, avèk mason ak chapant e tout mesye ak kapasite nan tout kalite mendèv. <verse eid="1CH 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 22:16" />Selon lò, ajan ak bwonz avèk fè, nanpwen limit. Leve, fè travay ou e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:11">I Kwo 22:11</ref></char></note>ke SENYÈ a kapab avèk ou.”<verse eid="1CH 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 22:17" />Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:1-6">I Kwo 28:1-6</ref></char></note>David te kòmande tout chèf Israël yo pou ede fis li a, Salomon. Li te di: <verse eid="1CH 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 22:18" />“Èske SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, pa avèk nou? Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:9">I Kwo 22:9</ref></char></note>èske Li pa t bannou repo sou tout kote? Paske Li te livre sila ki viv nan peyi yo nan men m, e peyi a soumèt nèt devan SENYÈ a ak devan pèp Li a. <verse eid="1CH 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 22:19" />Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:9">I Kwo 28:9</ref></char></note>bay kè nou avèk nanm nou pou chache SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an. Konsa, leve pou bati sanktiyè SENYÈ a, Bondye a, pou nou kapab pote lach akò SENYÈ a avèk veso sakre Bondye yo antre nan kay ki va bati pou non a SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="1CH 22:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1CH 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 23:1" />Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:28">I Kwo 29:28</ref></char></note>lè David te vin granmoun, li te fè fis li Salomon, wa sou Israël. <verse eid="1CH 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 23:2" />Li te ranmase tout chèf Israël yo avèk prèt ak Levit yo. <verse eid="1CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 23:3" />Levit yo te kontwole soti nan trant ane oswa plis e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:48">Nonb 4:48</ref></char></note>fòs non pa yo selon gwo chif kontwòl la, te trant-uit-mil. <verse eid="1CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 23:4" />Nan sila yo, venn-kat-mil te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 3:8-9">Esd 3:8-9</ref></char></note>pou sipèvize lèv lakay SENYÈ a, si-mil te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 26:29">I Kwo 26:29</ref></char></note>ofisye avèk jij, <verse eid="1CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 23:5" />kat-mil te gadyen pòtay yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:16">I Kwo 15:16</ref></char></note>kat-mil ki pou louwe SENYÈ a avèk enstriman ke David te fè pou bay lwanj yo.<verse eid="1CH 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 23:6" />David te divize yo an gwoup <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:1">I Kwo 6:1</ref></char></note>selon fanmi de fis yo a Lévi: Guerschon, Kehath, ak Merari.<verse eid="1CH 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 23:7" />Nan Gèshonit yo: Laedan avèk Schimeï. <verse eid="1CH 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 23:8" />Fis a Laedan yo: Jehiel, premye a, Zétham ak Joël, ki fè twa. <verse eid="1CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 23:9" />Fis a Shimei yo: Schelomith, Haziel avèk Haran, ki fè twa. Sila yo se te chèf lakay zansèt a Ladann yo. <verse eid="1CH 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 23:10" />Fis a Shimei yo: Jahath, Zina, Jeush avèk Berlah. Kat sila yo te fis a Schimeï. <verse eid="1CH 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 23:11" />Jachath se te premye a e Zina dezyèm nan; men Jeusch avèk Beria pa t fè anpil fis; akoz sa, yo te fòme yon sèl kay zansèt, yon sèl gwoup.<verse eid="1CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 23:12" />Fis a Kehath yo: Amram, Jitsehar, Hébron avèk Uziel, kat. <verse eid="1CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 23:13" />Fis a Anram yo: Aaron avèk Moïse. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:20">Egz 6:20</ref></char></note>Aaron te mete apa pou l te kab sanktifye li kote ki pi sen pase tout kote a, li menm avèk fis pa li yo jis pou tout tan, pou brile lansan devan SENYÈ a, pou fè sèvis pa Li, e pou beni nan non Li jis pou tout tan. <verse eid="1CH 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 23:14" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 33:1">Det 33:1</ref></char></note>Moïse, nonm Bondye a, fis pa li yo te rele pami tribi Lévi a. <verse eid="1CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 23:15" />Fis a Moïse yo: Guerschom avèk Éliézer. <verse eid="1CH 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 23:16" />Fis a Guerschom yo: Schebuel, chèf la. <verse eid="1CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 23:17" />Fis a Éliézer a te Rechabia, chèf la. Éliézer pa t gen lòt fis, men fis a Rechabia yo te an gran kantite. <verse eid="1CH 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 23:18" />Fis a Jitsehar a: Schelomith, chèf la. <verse eid="1CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 23:19" />Fis a Hébron yo: Jerija, premye a; Amaria, dezyèm nan, Jachaziel, twazyèm nan; epi Jekameam, katriyèm nan. <verse eid="1CH 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 23:20" />Fis a Uziel yo: Michée, premye a ak Jischija, dezyèm nan.<verse eid="1CH 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 23:21" />Fis a Merari yo: Machli avèk Muschi. Fis a Machli yo: Éléazar avèk Kis. <verse eid="1CH 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 23:22" />Éléazar te mouri san fè fis, men fi sèlman; pou sa, frè pa yo, fis a Kis yo te pran yo kon madanm pa yo. <verse eid="1CH 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 23:23" />Fis a Muschi yo: Machli, Éder avèk Jerémoth, twa.<verse eid="1CH 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 23:24" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 10:17-21">Nonb 10:17-21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sila yo se te fis a Lévi selon lakay zansèt pa yo, menm lakay zansèt a sila ki te kontwole nan kantite non nan gwo chif kontwòl la, sila ki t ap fè travay lakay SENYÈ a, soti nan ventan oswa plis. <verse eid="1CH 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 23:25" />Paske David te di: “SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:16">I Kwo 22:16</ref></char></note>te bay repo a pèp Li a, e Li va abite Jérusalem jis pou tout tan. <verse eid="1CH 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 23:26" />Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:5-15">Nonb 4:5-15</ref></char></note>Levit yo p ap ankò bezwen pote tabènak avèk tout zouti li yo pou sèvis li.” <verse eid="1CH 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 23:27" />Paske pa dènye pawòl a David yo, fis a Levi yo te kontwole soti ventan oswa plis. <verse eid="1CH 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 23:28" />Paske wòl pa yo se pou ede fis a Aaron yo avèk sèvis lakay SENYÈ a, nan gwo lakou yo, nan chanm yo ak nan pirifye tout bagay sen yo, menm travay a sèvis lakay Bondye a, <verse eid="1CH 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 23:29" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:5-9">Lev 24:5-9</ref></char></note>epi avèk pen konsakre ak farin fen pou yon ofrann sereyal, galèt san ledven, oswa sa ki kwit nan veso, ni sa ki byen mele ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:35-36">Lev 19:35-36</ref></char></note>tout mezi a volim oswa gwosè yo. <verse eid="1CH 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 23:30" />Yo gen pou kanpe chak maten pou bay remèsiman avèk lwanj a SENYÈ a, e menm jan an nan aswè, <verse eid="1CH 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 23:31" />epi pou ofri tout ofrann brile a SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:13-14">És 1:13-14</ref></char></note>nan Saba yo, nan nouvèl lin yo, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:2-4">Lev 23:2-4</ref> </char></note>fèt etabli yo nan kontwòl ki òdone selon òdonans de yo menm, tout tan san rete devan SENYÈ a. <verse eid="1CH 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 23:32" />Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:53">Nonb 1:53</ref></char></note>yo gen pou kenbe chaj sou asanble tant yo, chaj sou plas sen an e chaj sou fis Aaron yo, fanmi pa yo, pou sèvis lakay SENYÈ a.<verse eid="1CH 23:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1CH 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 24:1" />Alò, men divizyon a desandan a Aaron yo: fis a Aaron yo te Nadab, Abihu, Éléazar avèk Ithamar. <verse eid="1CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 24:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:2">Lev 10:2</ref></char></note>Nadab avèk Abihu te mouri avan papa yo, san yo pa t genyen fis. Pou sa, Éléazar avèk Ithamar te sèvi kon prèt. <verse eid="1CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 24:3" />David, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:8">I Kwo 6:8</ref></char></note>Tsadok, fis a Éléazar yo ak Achimélec a desandan a Ithamar yo, te divize yo selon fonksyon yo nan sèvis pa yo. <verse eid="1CH 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 24:4" />Akoz ke te gen plis chèf nan desandan a Éléazar yo pase nan desandan a Ithamar yo, yo te divize yo konsa: sèz chèf zansèt a desandan a Éléazar yo ak uit nan desandan Ithamar yo, selon lakay zansèt pa yo. <verse eid="1CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 24:5" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 24:31">I Kwo 24:31</ref></char></note>Konsa yo te divize pa tiraj osò, youn tankou lòt la; paske yo te sèvi kon ofisye nan sanktiyè a e ofisye a Bondye, e nan desandan a Éléazar yo ak desandan a Ithamar yo. <verse eid="1CH 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 24:6" />Schemaeja, fis a Nethaneel la, grefye pou trib Lévi a, te enskri yo nan prezans a wa a, chèf lakay zansèt yo, Tsadok, prèt la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 18:16">I Kwo 18:16</ref></char></note>Achimélec, fis a Abiathar a ak chèf a lakay zansèt a prèt avèk Levit yo; youn lakay zansèt ki te pran pou Éléazar yo e youn pou Ithamar yo.<verse eid="1CH 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 24:7" />Alò, premye tiraj osò a te tonbe pou Jehojarib; dezyèm nan pou Jedaeja; <verse eid="1CH 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 24:8" />twazyèm nan a Harim; katriyèm nan a Seorim; <verse eid="1CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 24:9" />senkyèm nan a Malkija; sizyèm nan a Mijamin; <verse eid="1CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 24:10" />setyèm nan a Hakkots; uityèm nan a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:4">Né 12:4</ref></char></note>Abija; <verse eid="1CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 24:11" />nevyèm nan a Josué; dizyèm nan a Schecania; <verse eid="1CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 24:12" />onzyèm nan a Éliaschib; douzyèm nan a Jakim; <verse eid="1CH 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 24:13" />trèzyèm nan a Huppa; katòzyèm nan a Jeschébeab; <verse eid="1CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 24:14" />kenzyèm nan a Bilga; sizyèm nan a Immer; <verse eid="1CH 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 24:15" />di-setyèm nan a Hézir; di-zuityèm nan a Happitsets; <verse eid="1CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 24:16" />diz-nevyèm nan a Pethachja; ventyèm nan a Ézéchiel; <verse eid="1CH 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 24:17" />ven-te-inyèm nan a Jakin; venn-dezyèm nan a Gamul; <verse eid="1CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 24:18" />venn-twazyèm nan a Delaja; venn-katriyèm nan a Maazia. <verse eid="1CH 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 24:19" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:25">I Kwo 9:25</ref></char></note>Sa yo te pozisyon sèvis yo te fè lè yo te antre lakay SENYÈ a selon règleman ki te bay a yo menm pa Aaron, zansèt pa yo, jis jan ke SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, te kòmande li a.<verse eid="1CH 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 24:20" />Alò, pou lòt fis a Lévi yo: nan fis Amram yo: Schubaël; nan fis a Schubaël yo: Jechdia; <verse eid="1CH 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 24:21" />a Rechabia: selon fis a Rechabia yo: chèf Jischija. <verse eid="1CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 24:22" />Selon Jitsearit yo: Schelomoth; nan fis a Schelomoth yo: Jachath. <verse eid="1CH 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 24:23" />Fis a Hébron yo: Jerija, premye a, Amaria, dezyèm nan, Jachaziel, twazyèm nan, Jekameam, katriyèm nan. <verse eid="1CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 24:24" />Selon fis a Uziel yo: Michée; epi fis a Michée yo, Shamir. <verse eid="1CH 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 24:25" />Frè a Michée a, Jischija; nan fis a Jischija yo: Zacharie. <verse eid="1CH 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 24:26" />Fis a Merari yo: Machli avèk Muschi; fis a Jaazija yo, Beno. <verse eid="1CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 24:27" />Fis a Merari yo: pa Jaazia, Beno, Schoham, Zaccur ak Ibri. <verse eid="1CH 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 24:28" />Pa Mahli: Éléazar ki pa t gen fis. <verse eid="1CH 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 24:29" />Pa Kis: nan fis a Kis yo, Jerachmeel. <verse eid="1CH 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 24:30" />Fis a Muschi yo: Machli, Éder ak Jerimoth. <verse eid="1CH 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 24:31" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 24:5-6">I Kwo 24:5-6</ref></char></note>Sila yo osi te voye kon tiraj osò tankou manm fanmi pa yo, fis a Aaron yo nan prezans a David, wa a, Tsadok avèk Achimélec, chèf lakay zansèt pa yo pami prèt ak Levit yo, chèf lakay papa pa yo jis jan sa ye pou nan pi piti frè li yo.<verse eid="1CH 24:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1CH 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 25:1" />Anplis, David avèk kòmandan lame yo te mete apa pou sèvis kèk nan fis a Asaph yo, Héman ak Jeduthun pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 3:15">II Wa 3:15</ref></char></note>pwofetize avèk gita yo, ap ak senbal; epi fòs kantite moun ki te fè sèvis pa yo se te: <verse eid="1CH 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 25:2" />Nan fis a Asaph yo: Zaccur, Joseph, Nethania avèk Aschareéla; fis a Asaph yo te anba direksyon a Asaph, ki te pwofetize anba direksyon a wa a. <verse eid="1CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 25:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:41-42">I Kwo 16:41-42</ref></char></note>Selon Juduthun, fis a Juduthun yo: Guedalia, Tseri, Ésaïe, Haschabia, Matthithia avèk Schimeï, sis, anba direksyon a papa yo, Juduthun, avèk ap la, ki te konn pwofetize nan bay remèsiman avèk lwanj SENYÈ a. <verse eid="1CH 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 25:4" />Selon Héman, fis a Héman nan: Bukkija, Matthania, Uziel, Schebuel, Jerimoth, Hanania, Hanani, Éliatha, Guiddalthi, Romamthi-Ézer, Joschbekascha, Mallòthi, Hothir, Machazioth. <verse eid="1CH 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 25:5" />Tout sila yo te fis a Héman yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:11">II Sam 24:11</ref></char></note>konseye a wa a ki pou bay li ekspiyasyon selon pawòl a Bondye; paske Bondye te bay katòz fis ak twa fi a Héman. <verse eid="1CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 25:6" />Tout te anba direksyon a papa yo pou chante lakay SENYÈ a, avèk senbal, ap ak gita yo, pou sèvis kay Bondye a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:16-19">I Kwo 15:16-19</ref></char></note>Asaph, Jeduthun avèk Héman te anba direksyon wa a. <verse eid="1CH 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 25:7" />Fòs kantite nan yo ki te prepare kon chantè a SENYÈ yo, avèk manm fanmi pa yo, tout te byen abil, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:5">I Kwo 23:5</ref></char></note>de-san-katreven-di-zuit. <verse eid="1CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 25:8" />Yo te tire osò pou travay tach yo, tout menm jan an, piti kon gran, pwofesè kon elèv.<verse eid="1CH 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 25:9" />Alò, premye tiraj osò a te tonbe a Asaph pou Joseph, dezyèm nan pou Guedalia, li menm, fanmi li ak fis pa li yo te fè douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 25:10" />Twazyèm nan a Zaccur, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 25:11" />katriyèm nan a Jìtseri, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 25:12" />senkyèm nan a Nethania, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 25:13" />sizyèm nan a Bukkija, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 25:14" />setyèm nan a Jesareéla, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 25:15" />uityèm nan a Ésaïe, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 25:16" />nevyèm nan a Matthania, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 25:17" />dizyèm nan a Schimeï, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 25:18" />onzyèm nan a Azareel, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 25:19" />douzyèm nan a Haschabia, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 25:20" />trèzyèm nan a Schubaël, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 25:21" />katòzyèm nan a Matthithia, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 25:22" />kenzyèm nan a Jerémoth, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 25:23" />sèzyèm nan a Hanania, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 25:24" />di-setyèm nan a Joschbekascha, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 25:25" />di-zuityèm nan a Hanani, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 25:26" />diz-nevyèm nan a Mallothi, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 25:27" />ventyèm nan a Élijatha, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 25:28" />ven-te-inyèm nan a Hothir, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 25:29" />venn-dezyèm nan a Guiddalthi, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 25:30" />venn-twazyèm nan a Machazioth, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz; <verse eid="1CH 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 25:31" />venn-katriyèm nan a Romamthi-Ézer, fis li yo avèk fanmi li, douz.<verse eid="1CH 25:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1CH 26" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 26:1" />Pou divizyon gadyen pòtay yo, te gen nan Koreyit yo; Meschélémia, fis a Koré a, fis yo a Asaph yo. <verse eid="1CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 26:2" />Meschélémia te gen fis: Zacharie, premye ne a, Jediaël, dezyèm nan, Zebadia, twazyèm nan, Jathiel, katriyèm nan, <verse eid="1CH 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 26:3" />Élam, senkyèm nan, Jochanan, sizyèm nan, Eljoénaï, setyèm nan. <verse eid="1CH 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 26:4" />Obed-Édom te gen fis: Schemaeja, premye ne a, Jozabad, dezyèm nan, Joach, twazyèm nan, Sacar, katriyèm nan, Nethaneel, senkyèm nan, <verse eid="1CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 26:5" />Ammiel, sizyèm nan, Issacar, setyèm nan, Peulthaï, uityèm nan; paske Bondye te vrèman beni li. <verse eid="1CH 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 26:6" />Anplis, a fis li, Schemaeja, te ne fis ki te renye sou lakay papa yo; paske yo te mesye pwisan ak gwo kouraj. <verse eid="1CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 26:7" />Fis a Schemaeja yo: Othni, Rephaël, Obed, Elzabad, avèk frè pa yo Élihu ak Semaeja ki te mesye ak gwo kouraj. <verse eid="1CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 26:8" />Tout nan sila yo, se te fis a Obed-Édom; yo menm avèk fis pa yo ak fanmi yo te mesye ak gwo kapasite, avèk fòs pou sèvis; swasann-de mesye ki sòti Obed-Édom. <verse eid="1CH 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 26:9" />Fis a Meschélémia yo, mesye plen ak kouraj te kontwole diz-uit mesye. <verse eid="1CH 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 26:10" />Anplis, Hosa, nan fis a Merari yo te fè fis: Schimri, premye a (malgre li pa t ne premyèman, men papa li te fè l premye), <verse eid="1CH 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 26:11" />Hilkija, dezyèm nan, Thebalia, twazyèm nan, Zacharie, katriyèm nan. Tout fis yo avèk fanmi a Hosa yo te trèz mesye.<verse eid="1CH 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 26:12" />Se nan divizyon a gadyen pòtay sila yo, mesye chèf yo te bay responsabilite kon fanmi pa yo pou fè sèvis lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="1CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 26:13" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 24:5-31">I Kwo 24:5-31</ref></char></note>Yo te tire yo osò, piti kon gran, selon lakay zansèt pa yo pou chak pòtay. <verse eid="1CH 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 26:14" />Tiraj osò ki tonbe pou lès la te devni pou Schélémia. Alò, yo te tire osò pou fis li a, Zacharie, yon konseye avèk bon konprann e tiraj osò li a te sòti nan nò. <verse eid="1CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 26:15" />Pou Obed-Édom li te tonbe vè sid e a fis li yo, te ale chanm depo yo. <verse eid="1CH 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 26:16" />Pou Schuppm avèk Hosa, li te tonbe kote lwès, akote pòt Schalléketh la, vè chemen monte a. Yo te pozisyone gad anfas gad. <verse eid="1CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 26:17" />Sou lès la, te gen sis Levit; nan nò a, kat chak jou e nan chanm depo yo, de pa de yon kote apa. <verse eid="1CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 26:18" />Nan cham bati sou kote lwès la, te gen kat sou gran chemen an e de nan cham nan a menm. <verse eid="1CH 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 26:19" />Sila yo se te divizyon a gadyen pòtay a fis a Kore yo avèk fis a Merari yo.<verse eid="1CH 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 26:20" />Levit yo avèk fanmi pa yo te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 26:22-26">I Kwo 26:22-26</ref></char></note>chaj sou trezò lakay Bondye a ak trezò a don konsakre yo. <verse eid="1CH 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 26:21" />Fis a Laedan yo, fis a Gèshonit yo, ki apatyen a Laedan, chèf lakay zansèt pa yo ki te rele Jehiéli, te tèt lakay zansèt pa yo ki te pou Laedan, Gèshonit lan. <verse eid="1CH 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 26:22" />Fis a Jehiéli yo, Zetham avèk Joël, frè li a, ki te an chaj trezò lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="1CH 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 26:23" />Pou Amramit yo, Jitsearit yo, Ebwonit avèk Izyelit yo, <verse eid="1CH 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 26:24" />Schebuel, fis a Guerschom an, fis a Moïse la te ofisye sou trezò yo. <verse eid="1CH 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 26:25" />Fanmi li pa Éliézer te Rechabia, fis li a, Ésaïe, fis li a, Joram, fis li a, Zicri, fis li a ak Schelomith, fis li a. <verse eid="1CH 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 26:26" />Schelomith sila avèk fanmi li te gen chaj sou tout trezò a don konsakre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:11">II Sam 8:11</ref></char></note>ke Wa David avèk chèf lakay zansèt yo, kòmandan a dè milye, a dè santèn e kòmandan lame yo te dedye. <verse eid="1CH 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 26:27" />Yo te dedye yon pati nan piyaj ki te sezi nan gè yo pou repare lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="1CH 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 26:28" />Epi tout sa ke Samuel, konseye a, te dedye e Saül, fis a Kis la, pa Abner, fis a Ner a, pa Joab, fis a Tseruja a, tout moun ki te dedye bagay anba jerans a Schelomith lan avèk fanmi pa li.<verse eid="1CH 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 26:29" />Pou Jitsearit yo, Kenania avèk frè pa li yo, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 11:16">Né 11:16</ref></char></note>te anplwaye pou zafè andeyò kon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:4">I Kwo 23:4</ref></char></note>majistra ak jij an Israël. <verse eid="1CH 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 26:30" />Pou Ebwonit yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 27:17">I Kwo 27:17</ref></char></note>Haschavbia avèk fanmi li, mil-sèt-san mesye ak kapasite, ki te an chaj tout zafè Israël yo nan lwès a Jourdain an, pou tout sèvis SENYÈ a ak sèvis wa a. <verse eid="1CH 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 26:31" />Pou Ebwonit yo, Jerija, chèf la, (Ebwonit sila yo te envestige selon listwa fanmi avèk zansèt pa yo, nan karantyèm ane nan règn David la e mesye ak kapasite siperyè yo te twouve pami yo kote Jaezer nan Galaad). <verse eid="1CH 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 26:32" />Moun fanmi pa li, mesye byen kapab, te de-mil-sèt-san òm, chèf lakay zansèt pa yo. Epi Wa David te fè yo sipèvizè sou Ribenit yo, Gadit yo ak mwatye tribi Manassé <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:11">II Kwo 19:11</ref></char></note>pou tout zafè Bondye avèk wa a.<verse eid="1CH 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1CH 27" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 27:1" />Men chif kontwòl a fis Israël yo, chèf lakay zansèt yo, kòmandan a dè milye, a dè santèn yo, avèk chèf pa yo ki te sèvi wa a nan tout afè divizyon ki te antre sòti mwa pa mwa pandan tout mwa nan ane yo, chak divizyon te konte a venn-kat-mil sòlda:<verse eid="1CH 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 27:2" />Sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 23:8-30">II Sam 23:8-30</ref></char></note>tèt a premye divizyon an pou premye mwa a te Jaschobeam, fis a Zabdiel la; nan divizyon pa li a te gen venn-kat-mil òm. <verse eid="1CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 27:3" />Sòti nan fis a Pérets yo, chèf a tout kòmandan lame a pou premye mwa a. <verse eid="1CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 27:4" />Sou tèt a divizyon dezyèm mwa a te Dodaï, Achochit la; Mikloth te youn nan chèf yo nan divizyon pa li yo; epi li te gen nan divizyon pa li a, venn-kat-mil òm. <verse eid="1CH 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 27:5" />Twazyèm kòmandan lame a pou twazyèm mwa a te Benaja, fis a prèt la, Jehojada kon chèf; epi nan divizyon pa li te gen venn-kat-mil òm. <verse eid="1CH 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 27:6" />Benaja sila a se te nonm pwisan a trant yo e li te an chaj sou trant yo; epi Ammizadab, fis li a, te sou divizyon pa li. <verse eid="1CH 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 27:7" />Katriyèm nan pou katriyèm mwa a te Asaël, frè a Joab la e apre li, Zebadia, fis li a; epi li te gen yon divizyon a venn-kat-mil òm. <verse eid="1CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 27:8" />Senkyèm nan pou senkyèm mwa a te kòmandan Schamehuth, Jizrachit la; epi te gen yon divizyon a venn-kat-mil òm. <verse eid="1CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 27:9" />Sizyèm nan pou sizyèm mwa a te Ira, fis a Ikkesch la, Tekoyit la; epi li te gen yon divizyon a venn-kat-mil òm. <verse eid="1CH 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 27:10" />Setyèm nan pou setyèm mwa a te Hélets, Pelonit lan, sòti nan fis a Éphraïm yo; li te gen yon divizyon a venn-kat-mil òm. <verse eid="1CH 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 27:11" />Uityèm nan, pou uityèm mwa a te Sibbecaï, Ouchatit la, sòti nan Zerachit yo; epi li te gen yon divizyon a venn-kat-mil òm. <verse eid="1CH 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 27:12" />Nevyèm nan pou nevyèm mwa a te Abiézer, Anathoth la, sòti nan Benjamit yo; epi li te gen yon divizyon a venn-kat-mil òm. <verse eid="1CH 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 27:13" />Dizyèm nan pou dizyèm mwa a te Maharaï, Netofayit la nan fanmi Zerachit yo; epi li te gen yon divizyon a venn-kat-mil òm. <verse eid="1CH 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 27:14" />Onzyèm nan pou onzyèm mwa a te Benaja, Piratit la, sòti nan fis Éphraïm nan; epi li te gen yon divizyon a venn-kat-mil òm. <verse eid="1CH 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 27:15" />Douzyèm nan, pou douzyèm mwa a te Heldaï, Netofit la, sòti nan fanmi Othniel la; epi li te gen yon divizyon venn-kat-mil òm.<verse eid="1CH 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 27:16" />Men chèf a tribi Israël yo. Chèf a Ribenit yo; Éliézer, fis a Icri a; pou Simeonit yo: Schephathia, fis a Maaca a; <verse eid="1CH 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 27:17" />pou Levit yo: Haschabia, fis a Kemuel la; nan fanmi Aaron an: Tsadok; <verse eid="1CH 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 27:18" />pou Juda: Élihu, frè a David la; pou Issacar: Omri, fis a Micaël la; <verse eid="1CH 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 27:19" />pou Zabulon: Jischemaeja, fis a Abdias la; pou Nephthali: Jerimoth, fis a Azriel la; <verse eid="1CH 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 27:20" />pou fis Éphraïm yo: Hosée, fis a Azazia a; pou mwatye tribi a Manassé a: Joël, fis a Pedaja a; <verse eid="1CH 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 27:21" />pou mwatye tribi Manassé nan Galaad: Jiddo, fis a Zacharie a, pou Benjamin: Jaasiel, fis a Abner a; <verse eid="1CH 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 27:22" />pou Dan: Azareel, fis a Jerocham nan. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:1">I Kwo 28:1</ref></char></note>Sila yo se te chèf a tribi Israël yo. <verse eid="1CH 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 27:23" />Men David pa t kontwole sila nan laj ventan oswa mwens yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 21:2-5">I Kwo 21:2-5</ref></char></note>akoz SENYÈ a te di Li ta miltipliye Israël kon zetwal syèl yo. <verse eid="1CH 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 27:24" />Joab, fis a Tseruja a, te kòmanse fè gwo kontwòl la, men li pa t fini; epi akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:12-15">II Sam 24:12-15</ref></char></note>gwo kòlè sa a ki te vin rive sou Israël e fòs kantite a pa t ladann nan chif kontwòl a Wa David la.<verse eid="1CH 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 27:25" />Alò, Azmaveth, fis Adiel la te an chaj depo trezò a wa a. Epi Jonathan, fis a Uzias la, te gen chaj a depo andeyò yo, nan vil yo, nan ti bouk yo ak nan wo fò anlè yo. <verse eid="1CH 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 27:26" />Ezri, fis a Kelub la te responsab tout ouvriye agrikòl ki te travay tè yo. <verse eid="1CH 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 27:27" />Schimeï, Ramatit la te gen chaj sou chan rezen yo; epi Zabdi, Shefamit lan, te an chaj tout pwodwi a chan rezen ki te depoze nan depo diven anba tè yo. <verse eid="1CH 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 27:28" />Baal-Hanan Gedetit la, te an chaj chan bwa oliv ak bwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:27">I Wa 10:27</ref></char></note>sikomò nan gran plèn nan e Joasch te an chaj depo lwil yo. <verse eid="1CH 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 27:29" />Schithraï, Sawonit lan te an chaj bèt ki t ap manje nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 5:16">I Kwo 5:16</ref></char></note>Saron yo; epi Schaphath, fis a Adlaï a, sou bèf ki te nan vale yo. <verse eid="1CH 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 27:30" />Obil, Izmayelit la, te an chaj chamo yo; epi Jechdia, Mewonotit la, te an chaj bourik yo. <verse eid="1CH 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 27:31" />Jaziz, Agarenyen an, te an chaj bann mouton yo. Tout sila yo te sipèvizè nan tèren ki te apatyen a Wa David la.<verse eid="1CH 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 27:32" />Anplis, Jonathan, tonton David la, te yon konseye, yon nonm ak bon konprann e yon skrib; epi Jehiel, fis a Hacmoni an, te pwofesè a fis Wa yo. <verse eid="1CH 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 27:33" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:12">II Sam 15:12</ref></char></note>Achitophel te yon konseye a wa a e Huschaï, Akyen an, te zanmi a wa a. <verse eid="1CH 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 27:34" />Jehojada, fis a Benaja a avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 1:7">I Kwo 1:7</ref></char></note>Abiathar te ranplase Achitophel; epi Joab te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 11:6">I Kwo 11:6</ref> </char></note>kòmandan lame wa a.<verse eid="1CH 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1CH 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 28:1" />Alò, David te rasanble nan Jérusalem tout ofisye Israël yo, chèf a tribi yo, kòmandan a divizyon ki te sèvi wa yo, kòmandan a dè milye yo avèk kòmandan a dè santèn yo, sipèvizè a tout teren avèk bèt ki te apatyen a wa a, avèk fis li yo, avèk ofisye yo ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 11:10-47">I Kwo 11:10-47</ref></char></note>mesye pwisan yo, menm tout mesye gwo kouraj yo. <verse eid="1CH 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 28:2" />Epi Wa David te leve sou pye li e te di: “Koute mwen, frè m yo ak pèp mwen an! Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 17:1-2">I Kwo 17:1-2</ref></char></note>te gen entansyon bati yon kay repo pou lach akò SENYÈ a e pou machpye Bondye nou an. Pou sa, mwen te fè preparasyon yo pou bati li. <verse eid="1CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 28:3" />Men Bondye te di mwen: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:8">I Kwo 22:8</ref></char></note>‘Ou p ap bati yon kay pou non Mwen, akoz ou se yon nonm lagè, e ou te vèse san.’ <verse eid="1CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 28:4" />Sepandan, SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:6-13">I Sam 16:6-13</ref></char></note>chwazi mwen soti nan tout lakay papa m pou vin wa sou Israël <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 17:23-27">I Kwo 17:23-27</ref></char></note>jis pou tout tan. <verse eid="1CH 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 28:5" />Pami tout fis mwen yo, (paske SENYÈ a te ban mwen anpil fis), <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:9-10">I Kwo 22:9-10</ref></char></note>Li te chwazi fis mwen an, Salomon pou chita sou twòn wayòm SENYÈ a sou Israël. <verse eid="1CH 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 28:6" />Li te di mwen: ‘Fis ou a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:13-14">II Sam 7:13-14</ref></char></note>Salomon, se li menm ki va bati kay Mwen an, ak tout lakou li yo; paske Mwen te chwazi Li pou devni yon fis pou Mwen e Mwen va yon papa pou li. <verse eid="1CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 28:7" />Mwen va etabli wayòm li jis pou tout tan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:13">I Kwo 22:13</ref></char></note>si avèk tout kè li, li fè kòmandman Mwen yo avèk règleman Mwen yo, jan sa ap fèt koulye a.’”<verse eid="1CH 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 28:8" />“Pou sa, koulye a, devan zye a tout Israël, asanble SENYÈ a e nan tande a Bondye nou an, swiv e pran a kè tout kòmandman a SENYÈ yo, Bondye nou an, pou nou kapab posede bon peyi a e bay li a fis apre nou yo, jis pou tout tan.<verse eid="1CH 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 28:9" />“Epi pou ou menm, fis mwen an, Salomon, fè konesans a Bondye papa ou a e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:61">I Wa 8:61</ref></char></note>sèvi li avèk tout kè ou e avèk bòn volonte; paske SENYÈ a chache nan tout kè yo e byen konprann entansyon a tout panse yo. Si ou chache Li, Li va kite ou jwenn Li; men si ou abandone Li, Li va rejte ou jis pou tout tan. <verse eid="1CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 28:10" />Koulye a, reflechi byen, paske SENYÈ a te fin chwazi ou menm pou bati yon kay pou sanktiyè a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:13">I Kwo 22:13</ref></char></note>Pran kouraj e aji.”<verse eid="1CH 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 28:11" />Epi David te bay a fis li Salomon, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Egz 25:40</ref></char></note>plan pou fè galri tanp lan, tout chanm li yo, avèk chanm trezò li yo, chanm anlè li yo, chanm enteryè li yo, ak chanm pou twòn pwopiyatwa a; <verse eid="1CH 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 28:12" />epi plan a tout sa ke li te gen nan tèt li, pou lakou lakay SENYÈ a e pou tout chanm ki te antoure l yo, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 26:20-28">I Kwo 26:20-28</ref></char></note>chanm trezò lakay Bondye yo, e pou chanm trezò pou tout bagay konsakre yo; <verse eid="1CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 28:13" />anplis, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 24:1">I Kwo 24:1</ref></char></note>divizyon a prèt yo avèk Levit yo pou tout travay sèvis lakay SENYÈ a e pou tout zouti sèvis lakay SENYÈ yo; <verse eid="1CH 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 28:14" />pou zouti an lò yo, lò pou tout zouti pou tout kalite sèvis yo, pou zouti an ajan yo, ajan pou tout zouti a tout kalite sèvis yo; <verse eid="1CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 28:15" />epi lò pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:31-39">Egz 25:31-39</ref></char></note>baz chandelye an lò yo avèk lanp pa li yo; epi ajan a baz chandelye an ajan yo, avèk pwa a chak baz avèk lanp pa li yo selon sèvis a chak chandelye; <verse eid="1CH 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 28:16" />epi pwa a lò a pou tab pen konsakre pou chak tab la; epi ajan pou tab an ajan yo; <verse eid="1CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 28:17" />epi fouchèt yo, basen yo ak krich an lò pi yo; epi pou bòl an lò yo avèk pwa pou chak bòl; epi pou bòl an ajan avèk pwa a chak bòl; <verse eid="1CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 28:18" />epi pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1-10">Egz 30:1-10</ref></char></note>lotèl lansan an lò rafine pa pwa; epi lò pou modèl a cha a, menm cheriben ki te ouvri zèl yo pou te kouvri lach akò SENYÈ a. <verse eid="1CH 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 28:19" />David te di: “SENYÈ a te fè M konprann avèk men L ki te ekri pou mwen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:11-12">I Kwo 28:11-12</ref></char></note>tout detay a modèl sila a.”<verse eid="1CH 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 28:20" />Konsa, David te di a fis li, Salomon: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:13">I Kwo 22:13</ref></char></note>“Kenbe fèm, pran kouraj e aji pran desizyon. Pa pè, ni dekouraje, paske SENYÈ a, Bondye a, avèk ou. Li p ap fè fayit, ni Li p ap abandone ou jiskaske ke tout lèv pou lakay SENYÈ a fini. <verse eid="1CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 28:21" />Alò, gade byen, men divizyon a prèt yo avèk Levit yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 35:25-35">Egz 35:25-35</ref></char></note>pou tout sèvis lakay Bondye yo e tout mesye avèk kapasite yo va avèk ou nan travay la pou tout kalite sèvis yo. Anplis, ofisye yo avèk tout pèp la va disponib nèt sou lòd pa ou.”<verse eid="1CH 28:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1CH 29" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 29:1" />Epi Wa David te di a tout asanble a: “Fis mwen an, Salomon, ki sèl pou kont li Bondye te chwazi a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:5">I Kwo 22:5</ref></char></note> toujou jèn, san gwo eksperyans e travay la byen gwo. Paske tanp lan pa pou lòm, men pou SENYÈ a, Bondye a. <verse eid="1CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 29:2" />Alò, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:3-5">I Kwo 22:3-5</ref></char></note>tout kapasite mwen, mwen te fè pwovizyon pou lakay Bondye mwen a; lò, pou bagay fèt an lò yo, ajan pou bagay fèt an ajan yo, bwonz pou bagay fèt an bwonz yo, fè pou bagay fèt an fè yo, bwa pou bagay fèt an bwa yo, pyè oniks pou bagay fèt an pyè oniks yo, pyè byen prezante, pyè briyan avèk anpil koulè ak tout kalite pyè presye avèk mab blan an gran kantite. <verse eid="1CH 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 29:3" />Anplis, nan gran lajwa mwen pou lakay Bondye mwen an, trezò pèsonèl ke mwen gen an lò avèk ajan, mwen bay li a lakay Bondye mwen an; anplis de sou sa ke m te founi deja pou sen tanp lan, <verse eid="1CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 29:4" />kon swivan:<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:14">I Kwo 22:14</ref></char></note> twa mil talan lò nan lò Ophir ak sèt mil talan ajan rafine, pou kouvri mi kay yo; <verse eid="1CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 29:5" />lò pou bagay an lò e ajan pou bagay an ajan, sa vle di, pou tout lèv ki fèt pa mèt ouvriye yo. Pou sa, se kilès k ap konsakre li nan jou sa a SENYÈ a?”<verse eid="1CH 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 29:6" />Answit <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 27:1">I Kwo 27:1</ref></char></note>chèf lakay zansèt yo, chèf a tribi Israël yo e kòmandan a dè milye e a dè santèn yo, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 27:25-31">I Kwo 27:25-31</ref> </char></note>sipèvizè sou travay a wa a, te bay ofrann avèk bòn volonte; <verse eid="1CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 29:7" />epi pou sèvis lakay Bondye a, yo te bay senk-mil talan avèk di-mil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 2:69">Esd 2:69</ref></char></note>kilo an lò, di mil talan ajan, di-zui-mil talan bwonz ak san-mil-talan an fè. <verse eid="1CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 29:8" />Nenpòt moun ki te posede pyè presye, yo te bay yo a trezò lakay SENYÈ a, sou jerans a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:8">I Kwo 23:8</ref></char></note>Jehiel, Gèshonit lan. <verse eid="1CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 29:9" />Epi pèp la te rejwi paske yo te ofri sa tèlman ak bòn volonte, paske yo te fè ofrann a SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:61">I Wa 8:61</ref></char></note>avèk tout kè yo, epi Wa David osi te rejwi anpil.<verse eid="1CH 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 29:10" />Konsa, David te beni SENYÈ a devan zye a tout asanble a. David te di: “Beni se Ou menm, O SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, papa nou, jis pou tout tan e tout tan. <verse eid="1CH 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 29:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:13">Mat 6:13</ref></char></note>A Ou menm, O SENYÈ a, grandè, avèk pouvwa, avèk glwa, ak viktwa, ak majeste! Paske anverite, tout sa ki nan syèl la ak sou tè a se a Ou menm. Tout règn se pa W, O SENYÈ, e Ou egzalte kon tèt sou tout . <verse eid="1CH 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 29:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 1:12">II Kwo 1:12</ref></char></note>Ni richès, ni onè se nan Ou yo sòti, e Ou regne sou tout. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:6">II Kwo 20:6</ref></char></note>Nan men Ou se pouvwa ak pwisans. Se nan men W pou fè moun pwisan, e pou bay tout moun fòs. <verse eid="1CH 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 29:13" />Koulye a, pou sa, Bondye nou an, nou remèsye Ou, e bay glwa a non Ou ki plen ak glwa a. <verse eid="1CH 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 29:14" />Men se kilès mwen ye, e kilès pèp mwen an ye, pou nou ta kapab ofri ak jenewozite sa a? Paske tout bagay sòti nan Ou, e nou te bay Ou sa ki deja pa W. <verse eid="1CH 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 29:15" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:23">Lev 25:23</ref></char></note>nou se vwayajè devan Ou, lokatè, tankou tout zansèt nou yo te ye. Jou nou sou latè a se tankou lonbraj e nanpwen espwa. <verse eid="1CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 29:16" />O SENYÈ a, Bondye pa nou an, tout abondans sa ke nou te founi pou bati yon kay pou non sen pa Ou, soti nan men Ou, e tout se pou Ou. <verse eid="1CH 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 29:17" />Mwen konnen tou, O Bondye mwen an, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:9">I Kwo 28:9</ref></char></note>Ou fè sonde tout kè, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 15:2">Sòm 15:2</ref></char></note>pran plezi nan ladwati. Pou mwen menm, ak yon kè entèg, mwen te ofri avèk bòn volonte tout sila yo. Epi koulye a, avèk jwa, mwen gen tan wè pèp Ou a, ki prezan isit la, pou fè sakrifis ak bòn volonte a Ou menm. <verse eid="1CH 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 29:18" />O SENYÈ, Bondye a Abraham nan, Issac avèk Israël, papa zansèt pa nou yo, sere sa jis pou tout tan nan entansyon kè a pèp Ou a, e dirije kè yo vè Ou menm. <verse eid="1CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 29:19" />Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:9">I Kwo 28:9</ref></char></note>bay a fis mwen an, Salomon, yon kè entèg pou kenbe tout kòmandman Ou yo, temwayaj Ou yo ak règleman Ou yo, pou fè tout sa, pou bati tanp lan, pou sila mwen te fè pwovizyon an.”<verse eid="1CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 29:20" />Konsa, David te di a tout asanble a: “Koulye a, beni SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 29:20">Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 22:33">Jos 22:33</ref></char></note>tout asanble a te beni SENYÈ a, Bondye a zansèt pa yo a, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:31">Egz 4:31</ref></char></note>bese ba devan SENYÈ a e ak wa a. <verse eid="1CH 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 29:21" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:62-63">I Wa 8:62-63</ref></char></note>Yo te fè sakrifis a SENYÈ a, e nan pwochèn jou a te ofri ofrann brile a SENYÈ a; mil towo, mil belye ak mil jenn mouton avèk ofrann bwason pa yo ak sakrifis an gran kantite pou tout Israël. <verse eid="1CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 29:22" />Yo te manje ak bwè nan jou sa a devan SENYÈ a avèk kè kontan. Konsa, yo te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:1">I Kwo 23:1</ref></char></note>Salomon, fis a David la, wa pou yon dezyèm fwa, e yo te onksyone li devan SENYÈ a pou l ta prens, ak Tsadok kon prèt la.<verse eid="1CH 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 29:23" />Apre, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:12">I Wa 2:12</ref></char></note>Salomon te chita sou twòn SENYÈ a kon wa olye David, papa li. Li te byen reyisi, e tout Israël te obeyi a li menm. <verse eid="1CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 29:24" />Tout ofisye yo, mesye pwisan yo e anplis, tout fis a Wa David yo, te sèmante fidelite a Wa Salomon. <verse eid="1CH 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 29:25" />SENYÈ a te egzalte Salomon byen wo nan zye a tout Israël, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:13">I Wa 3:13</ref></char></note>bay li yon majeste wayal ki pa t sou okenn wa avan li an Israël.<verse eid="1CH 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 29:26" />Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 18:14">I Kwo 18:14</ref></char></note>David, fis a Jesse a te renye sou tout Israël. <verse eid="1CH 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 29:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:4-5">II Sam 5:4-5</ref></char></note>Fòs tan ke li te renye sou Israël la se te karantan; li te renye Hébron pandan setan e Jérusalem pandan trann-twazan. <verse eid="1CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 29:28" />Epi li te mouri a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:15">Jen 15:15</ref></char></note>yon gwo laj, trè avanse plen avèk jou, richès, avèk onè. Epi fis li a, Salomon te renye nan plas li. <verse eid="1CH 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 29:29" />Alò, zèv a Wa David yo, premye a jis rive nan dènye a, yo ekri nan Kwonik a Samuel yo, konseye a, nan Kwonik a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:2-4">II Sam 7:2-4</ref></char></note>Nathan yo, pwofèt la ak nan Kwonik a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 22:5">I Sam 22:5</ref></char></note>Gad yo, vwayan a, <verse eid="1CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 29:30" />avèk tout règn li, pouvwa li ak sikonstans ki te rive sou li yo, sou Israël ak sou tout wayòm a peyi yo.<verse eid="1CH 29:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 29" />
</usx>